01:49:22.860 --> 01:49:24.060
Rep. Maria Carmen S. Zamora: Mr. Speaker, Your Honor.

asr-001732
01:49:24.180 --> 01:49:52.860
Rep. Maria Carmen S. Zamora: In the implementation of the school-based feeding program, since the procurement is already under the division level, so the procurement is already localized and the produce of the local farmers are being considered in the procurement of the rice.

asr-001733
01:49:52.860 --> 01:50:10.120
Rep. Maria Carmen S. Zamora: And in fact, the data of the DepEd shows that around 35.2 million na ang nagagamit natin in the procurement from the local farmers in line with the implementation of the program.

asr-001734
01:50:10.520 --> 01:50:13.760
Rep. Maria Carmen S. Zamora: So this is in line with the Sagip Saka Act.

