asr-001747
01:51:41.900 --> 01:51:48.240
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Halimbawa po, nakalagay dito yung pondo para sa 18-day campaign to end violence against women.

asr-001748
01:51:48.620 --> 01:51:51.900
