asr-001752
01:52:02.100 --> 01:52:05.180
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Pagtatayo ng ating mga Committee on Decorum and Investigation.

asr-001753
01:52:05.960 --> 01:52:11.760
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Yung awareness tungkol sa paglaban sa kahit anong forma ng gender-based sexual harassment.

asr-001754
01:52:12.440 --> 01:52:19.060
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Nandito rin po yung kung paano natin na-integrate yung gender and development sa Human Rights Month.

asr-001755
01:52:19.440 --> 01:52:21.860
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ang nais po sana nating makita at manghihingi na lang po ako ng

asr-001756
01:52:21.980 --> 01:52:26.100
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: detalyadong ulat mula sa DepEd,

asr-001757
01:52:26.920 --> 01:52:30.520
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: tungkol dun sa kung paano po natin na-integrate sa major programs.

asr-001758
01:52:30.700 --> 01:52:32.740
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: For instance, sa school-based feeding program,

asr-001759
01:52:34.020 --> 01:52:38.660
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: are we able to employ, for instance, mothers who are not employed,

asr-001760
01:52:38.800 --> 01:52:40.100
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: who are still looking for work,

asr-001761
01:52:40.680 --> 01:52:48.380
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: as cooks or workers in the particular community kitchen.

asr-001762
01:52:48.460 --> 01:52:51.380
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: So may mga ganun po na maari po tayong...

asr-001763
01:52:51.980 --> 01:52:59.360
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: may mga pamamaraan para talagang integrate din yung economic empowerment ng women

asr-001764
01:52:59.360 --> 01:53:05.300
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: at ng mga marginalized communities natin and all gender diverse people sa mga programa.

asr-001765
01:53:05.300 --> 01:53:08.360
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: So yun po sana yung gusto natin makita dun sa Utilization Report.

asr-001766
01:53:08.360 --> 01:53:15.280
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Yung kompletong ulat kung paano yung mga major programs integrated ang gender and development

asr-001767
01:53:15.280 --> 01:53:20.660
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: at hindi po separated, hindi nakahiwalay dun sa mga major programs.

asr-001768
01:53:20.660 --> 01:53:21.820
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Panghuli na lang po,

asr-001769
01:53:21.820 --> 01:53:25.660
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: tungkol sa ating Learner Support Program.

asr-001770
01:53:27.200 --> 01:53:31.200
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Mr. Speaker, higit po ba sa academic performance?

asr-001771
01:53:31.400 --> 01:53:38.980
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Paano po tinitiyak ng DepEd na ang ating mga mag-aaral ay nahuhubog upang mag-isip ng kritikal,

asr-001772
01:53:39.820 --> 01:53:47.220
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: gumawa ng wastong desisyon, magamit ang kanilang mabuti at informed na pagpapasya

asr-001773
01:53:47.220 --> 01:53:51.600
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: at maging responsable at aktibo na nakikilahok?

asr-001774
01:53:51.820 --> 01:53:58.580
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Na mamamayang Pilipino, lalong-lalo na po ngayon sa harap ng mga hindi po madali, napakamasalimuot

asr-001775
01:53:58.580 --> 01:54:06.200
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: na mga esyong panlipunan at mga concerns na may kinalaban sa kapakanan ng mga mag-aaral

asr-001776
01:54:06.200 --> 01:54:08.860
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: at sa kaligtasan ng ating mga paaralan.

asr-001777
01:54:19.900 --> 01:54:21.160
Rep. Maria Carmen S. Zamora: Mr. Speaker, Your Honor.

asr-001778
01:54:21.820 --> 01:54:48.860
Rep. Maria Carmen S. Zamora: To strengthen the development of critical thinking skills among learners, sinisiguro ng department na maging bahagi ito sa lahat ng ginagawang improvement on the formulation of the curriculum.

asr-001779
01:54:48.860 --> 01:54:50.860
Rep. Maria Carmen S. Zamora: Sinisiguro ng department na...

asr-001780
01:54:51.820 --> 01:55:03.500
Rep. Maria Carmen S. Zamora: Yung skill ng mga bata ay maging kabahagi doon sa lahat ng mga itinuturo based on the curriculum set by the department.

asr-001781
01:55:03.680 --> 01:55:04.500
Rep. Maria Carmen S. Zamora: Mr. Speaker, Your Honor.

asr-001782
01:55:05.580 --> 01:55:16.480
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Mr. Speaker, ano po ba yung mga dagdag na resources na kailangan ng DepEd upang mapalakas ang mga programa sa pangkabuan na paghuhubog ng mga mag-aaral?

asr-001783
01:55:16.480 --> 01:55:21.480
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: At matiyak po na yung pagkakataong ito ay makarating sa bawat estudyanteng

asr-001784
01:55:21.820 --> 01:55:22.860
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: nangangailangan

asr-001787
01:55:22.980 --> 01:55:24.180
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Sa buong bansa.

asr-001788
01:55:24.740 --> 01:55:34.580
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Nakita kasi natin, ginoong speaker para po sa susunod na taon may pagkalaki-laking 37% na budget cut ang learner Support Program.

asr-001789
01:55:35.100 --> 01:55:44.040
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: At sa tingin ko po sa panahon ngayon, isa po itong hindi makatarungan na hakbang kung kakaltasan ng pagkalaki-laki itong Learner Support Program.

asr-001790
01:55:44.380 --> 01:55:47.940
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Maari ba ang magpaliwanag dito ang ating author?

asr-001791
01:55:47.940 --> 01:55:52.280
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ano pong balak ng DepEd na sa harap po ng ganito kalaking budget cut?

asr-001792
01:55:53.000 --> 01:56:02.640
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: At walang pondo o kulangang pondo pero malaki pong pangangailangan sa ngayon para sa ganitong tipo ng mga support programs.

asr-001793
01:56:03.400 --> 01:56:17.020
Rep. Maria Carmen S. Zamora: Sir Speaker, Your Honor, some of the strategies to be implemented by the department as to the improvement of critical thinking skills among learners

asr-001794
01:56:17.020 --> 01:56:27.960
Rep. Maria Carmen S. Zamora: is to expand its elective subjects nationwide and to introduce to grade 12 learners NC3 qualifications.

asr-001795
01:56:28.640 --> 01:56:42.760
Rep. Maria Carmen S. Zamora: This also includes life and career skills and becoming it as the core of the skills.

asr-001796
01:56:43.800 --> 01:56:46.760
Rep. Maria Carmen S. Zamora: To improve also to increase work immersion.

asr-001797
01:56:47.020 --> 01:56:58.040
Rep. Maria Carmen S. Zamora: And to strengthen the electives for career-aligned critical thinking skills.

asr-001798
01:56:58.040 --> 01:57:05.960
Rep. Maria Carmen S. Zamora: So, yun ay ilan lamang sa mga strategies na gagawin ng Department of Education.

asr-001799
01:57:06.960 --> 01:57:15.860
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Mr. Speaker, pwede niyo po bang bigyan niyong representasyon na ito yung particulars ng 37% na budget cut na gusto po natin makita?

asr-001800
01:57:16.020 --> 01:57:16.260
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Kasi,

asr-001801
01:57:17.020 --> 01:57:20.160
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: sa mga legal basis naman po ng ating learner support program,

asr-001802
01:57:20.620 --> 01:57:26.840
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: ang malaking bahagi po sa aming pag-aaral ay tungkol sa pagpapatupad ng ating National Mental Health Policy.

asr-001803
01:57:27.840 --> 01:57:31.400
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: So, kung baga, kung hindi po natin ito pupondohan ng maayos,

asr-001804
01:57:31.400 --> 01:57:37.780
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: paano natin maaasahan na yung agaran na abot kamay, na counseling,

asr-001805
01:57:38.440 --> 01:57:45.540
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: iba't ibang support services sa ating mga learners, pati na rin sa mga teachers at lahat ng ating education stakeholders

asr-001806
01:57:45.540 --> 01:57:46.400
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: ay,

asr-001807
01:57:47.020 --> 01:57:50.580
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: madaling maabot sa kanilang mga paaralan.

asr-001808
01:57:51.240 --> 01:57:58.360
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Bukod pa dito, ginong speaker, nakita rin po natin na ay hindi po malinaw at hindi pantay-pantay, halimbawa,

asr-001809
01:57:58.360 --> 01:58:08.280
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: yung pagpupondo dun sa mga spaces sana for socialization ng mga bata ng buong community sa isang eskwelahan.

asr-001810
01:58:08.660 --> 01:58:16.980
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Halimbawa po, yung napakahalaga na pagkakaroon ng mga libraries na may sapat na espasyo at ventilation para sa mga learners,

asr-001811
01:58:17.020 --> 01:58:20.020
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: pagkakaroon ng playground,

asr-001812
01:58:20.020 --> 01:58:26.020
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: pagkakaroon ng mga community garden kung saan pwede magkaroon,

asr-001813
01:58:26.020 --> 01:58:34.020
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: at yung ganitong tipo po ng mga espasyo para rin sa mga student organizations ng ating mga paaralan.

asr-001814
01:58:35.020 --> 01:58:42.020
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Yung tambayan po parang, kung baga, a luxury. Hindi po lahat ay meron maayos na tambayan.

asr-001815
01:58:42.020 --> 01:58:46.020
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: In fact, marami po sa mga lugar natin, makikita natin sa kanilang mga parks,

asr-001816
01:58:47.020 --> 01:58:54.020
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: or mga multi-purpose hall, habang may nagbabasketball sa isang parte, may nagme-meeting sa isang parte,

asr-001817
01:58:54.020 --> 01:58:58.020
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: may nagpa-practice ng plans for a school event sa isang parte.

asr-001818
01:58:58.020 --> 01:59:06.020
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: So, kung baga, kulang na kulang po yung facilities natin para sa holistic development ng ating mga learners,

asr-001819
01:59:06.020 --> 01:59:08.020
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: ng ating education stakeholders.

asr-001820
01:59:08.020 --> 01:59:13.020
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Kaya po, sinusuportahan po natin ang mas mataas na pondo para sa Department of Education,

asr-001821
01:59:13.020 --> 01:59:16.020
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: lalong-lalo na sa mga nabanggit nating programa,

asr-001822
01:59:16.020 --> 01:59:22.020
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: school-based feeding program, learning or learner support services and program.

asr-001823
01:59:22.020 --> 01:59:27.020
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Lahat po na may kinalaman sa mental health at support services.

asr-001824
01:59:27.020 --> 01:59:33.020
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Maraming maraming salamat, Mr. Speaker. Maraming salamat sa ating distinguished sponsor, DepEd Family.

asr-001825
01:59:33.020 --> 01:59:41.020
Rep. Maria Carmen S. Zamora: Mr. Speaker, thank you also for the manifestation of support by your honor to the proposed programs of the Department of Education.

asr-001826
01:59:41.020 --> 01:59:43.020
Deputy Speaker Francisco Paolo P. Ortega V: Majority Leader?

asr-001827
01:59:43.020 --> 01:59:45.020
Rep. Alyssa Michaela "Mica" M. Gonzales: Mr. Speaker, next to interpellate the sponsor,

asr-001828
01:59:46.020 --> 01:59:52.020
Rep. Alyssa Michaela "Mica" M. Gonzales: I move to recognize Representative Dada Kiram Ismula of party-list Akbayan.

asr-001829
01:59:54.020 --> 01:59:59.720
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Assalamualaikum warahmatullahi wabarakatuhu. Magandang umaga po sa ating lahat.

asr-001830
02:00:00.260 --> 02:00:08.000
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Didiretso na po ako. Una ko pong i-focus yung patungkol sa Asatids compensation.

asr-001831
02:00:09.800 --> 02:00:25.080
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Mr. Speaker, Madam Sponsor, parte ng Madrasa Education Program ang Arabic Language and Islamic Values Education, kung saan ang ating mga Asatids ang nagtuturo sa Muslim learners.

asr-001832
02:00:25.080 --> 02:00:34.180
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Can you confirm na ang current monthly baseline compensation ng mga Asatids under contract of service ay P12,500?

asr-001833
02:00:49.280 --> 02:00:54.180
Rep. Maria Carmen S. Zamora: Sir Speaker, Your Honor, the compensation of Asatids,

asr-001834
02:00:55.080 --> 02:01:05.520
Rep. Maria Carmen S. Zamora: is at P12,500 per month, and it was implemented in 2024.

asr-001835
02:01:06.380 --> 02:01:18.300
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Maraming salamat po. Meron po bang plano ang DepEd na i-increase ang monthly baseline compensation na ito para mas maging fair at sustainable ang support sa ating mga Asatids?

asr-001836
02:01:19.020 --> 02:01:24.300
Rep. Maria Carmen S. Zamora: Sir Speaker, Your Honor, the proposal for increase of...

asr-001837
02:01:25.080 --> 02:01:33.680
Rep. Maria Carmen S. Zamora: Sir Speaker, Your Honor, the proposal for increase of honorarium is part of the wish list of the department na sana from P12,500 per month magiging P16,000 per month.

asr-001838
02:01:34.840 --> 02:01:40.300
Rep. Maria Carmen S. Zamora: But again, that is still part of the wish list and that depends sa kongreso.

asr-001839
02:01:40.900 --> 02:01:42.300
Rep. Maria Carmen S. Zamora: Sir Speaker, your Honor.

asr-001840
02:01:42.300 --> 02:01:46.460
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: So mula sa P12,500 magiging P16,000.

asr-001841
02:01:47.100 --> 02:01:53.580
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: But this is still subject to the availability of funds kung ma-approve yung wish list ng DepEd.

asr-001842
02:01:53.580 --> 02:01:54.220
Rep. Maria Carmen S. Zamora: That is correct.

asr-001843
02:01:55.080 --> 02:01:56.920
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Maraming salamat, good sponsor.

asr-001844
02:01:57.500 --> 02:02:03.840
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Last year na-raise ko na merong issue sa delay ng pag-disburst ng compensation ng ating mga Asatids.

asr-001845
02:02:04.440 --> 02:02:13.840
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Nais ko lamang i-commend ang DepEd dahil nagkaroon po ng significant improvement sa timeline ng release ng compensation for our Asatids.

asr-001846
02:02:14.920 --> 02:02:19.840
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Sana po ay tuloy-tuloy na masiguro ng DepEd ang timely na release na ito.

asr-001847
02:02:20.840 --> 02:02:24.840
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Distinguished sponsor, another point lang sa madrasa, education program.

asr-001848
02:02:25.080 --> 02:02:40.340
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Before I proceed to another topic, I would like to manifest na mas mababa po ang proposed madrasa education program budget for 2027 kung ikumpara po natin ito sa 2026 GAA level.

asr-001849
02:02:40.860 --> 02:02:51.360
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Dahil dito, naninindigan po kami na ang pondo para sa madrasa education program ay dapat ma-restore man lang sa 2026 GAA level

asr-001850
02:02:51.360 --> 02:02:55.060
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: upang matiyak ang sapat na compensation at support.

asr-001851
02:02:55.080 --> 02:03:03.620
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Para sa ating mga Asatids at Muslim learners, nadako po ako sa ISAL teachers.

asr-001852
02:03:04.880 --> 02:03:17.220
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Distinguished sponsor, noong nakaraang budget briefing ay masaya po tayong malaman mula kay sekretary po mismo na ang mga ISAL teachers from Sulu ay i-aabsorb ng DepEd.

asr-001853
02:03:17.220 --> 02:03:25.060
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Madam sponsor, I would just like to clarify kung ang pag-aabsorb po ba sa kanila ay sa pamamagitan.

asr-001854
02:03:25.080 --> 02:03:31.280
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Sa pamamagitan po ba ng re-appointment o kailangan po ba silang sumailalim sa re-application?

asr-001855
02:03:50.100 --> 02:03:53.000
Rep. Maria Carmen S. Zamora: Sir Speaker, Your Honor.

asr-001856
02:03:53.000 --> 02:03:55.080
Rep. Maria Carmen S. Zamora: With the existing...

asr-001857
02:03:55.080 --> 02:04:03.140
Rep. Maria Carmen S. Zamora: With the existing around 800 ISALs, they will be absorbed by the department.

asr-001858
02:04:04.140 --> 02:04:06.920
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Re-application or re-appointment?

asr-001859
02:04:08.140 --> 02:04:11.600
Rep. Maria Carmen S. Zamora: Mr. Speaker, Your Honor, walang re-application na mangyari.

asr-001860
02:04:11.960 --> 02:04:14.060
Rep. Maria Carmen S. Zamora: They will automatically be absorbed.

asr-001861
02:04:14.300 --> 02:04:19.680
Rep. Maria Carmen S. Zamora: However, they will be subject to training, further training, Mr. Speaker, Your Honor.

asr-001862
02:04:19.680 --> 02:04:20.720
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Maraming salamat po.

asr-001863
02:04:21.200 --> 02:04:23.680
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Gusto ko lamang po din i-clarify.

asr-001864
02:04:25.080 --> 02:04:26.600
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Pinapaabot ng mga tanong po.

asr-001865
02:04:26.940 --> 02:04:28.600
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Kailan po kaya sila magsisimula?

asr-001866
02:04:33.040 --> 02:04:39.060
Rep. Maria Carmen S. Zamora: Sir Speaker, Your Honor, they will be absorbed effective January 1, 2027.

asr-001867
02:04:39.840 --> 02:04:52.080
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Hindi po ba kaya magkakaroon ng pagkaantala dahil madi-delay po or by January pa sila magsisimula dahil may ilang buwan pa tayo bago matapos yung 2026?

asr-001868
02:04:52.080 --> 02:04:52.840
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: 2026.

asr-001869
02:04:55.080 --> 02:05:11.060
Rep. Maria Carmen S. Zamora: Sir Speaker, Your Honor, the compensation, their compensation will be still under BARM from today until December of this year.

asr-001870
02:05:11.220 --> 02:05:16.520
Rep. Maria Carmen S. Zamora: And then effective January of 2027, DepEd will absorb for their compensation.

asr-001871
02:05:18.120 --> 02:05:24.640
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Madam Sponsor, gusto ko lamang po kasing makakuha ng assurance mula sa DepEd.

asr-001872
02:05:25.080 --> 02:05:34.780
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Na ano po kaya ang assurance na kasalukuyang mga ISAL teachers natin ay maaabsorb po ba talaga?

asr-001873
02:05:35.020 --> 02:05:36.960
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Can the DepEd commit to this po?

asr-001874
02:05:38.900 --> 02:05:41.600
Rep. Maria Carmen S. Zamora: Sir Speaker, Your Honor, the DepEd is committed.

asr-001875
02:05:42.040 --> 02:05:42.840
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Maraming salamat.

asr-001876
02:05:43.600 --> 02:05:46.820
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: I just want to put that on record dahil nanonood po sila ngayon.

asr-001877
02:05:47.120 --> 02:05:55.020
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Anyway, maari po ba nating malaman kung kailan ang effective date nila?

asr-001878
02:05:55.020 --> 02:05:58.960
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Nasabi niyo po kanina January, effective what January time po?

asr-001879
02:05:59.640 --> 02:06:00.880
Rep. Maria Carmen S. Zamora: January 1, Mr. Speaker.

asr-001880
02:06:01.160 --> 02:06:02.460
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Maraming salamat po.

asr-001881
02:06:03.600 --> 02:06:14.020
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Nakakabahala po kasi na hanggang ngayon ay wala pa tayong nailabas na omnibus hiring guidelines or reappointment guidelines or absorption guidelines.

asr-001882
02:06:15.240 --> 02:06:19.020
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Nilalagay nito ang ating mga ISAL teachers sa isang limbo.

asr-001883
02:06:19.020 --> 02:06:24.740
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Hindi nila alam kung sila ba ay mahahire or mariri-appoint?

asr-001884
02:06:25.020 --> 02:06:26.040
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Or maaabsorb?

asr-001885
02:06:26.400 --> 02:06:31.660
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Kung kinakailangan nilang maghanap ng iba pang trabaho, at least alam nila in advance.

asr-001886
02:06:32.220 --> 02:06:43.040
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Mr. Speaker, Madam Sponsor, sana po ay madaliin ng DepEd ang pagpapalabas ng omnibus hiring guidelines or absorption guidelines ba yan?

asr-001887
02:06:43.040 --> 02:06:49.560
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Sa lalong madaling panahon upang mabigyan ng kapanataga ng ating mga ISAL teachers.

asr-001888
02:06:50.300 --> 02:06:54.040
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: May katanungan lang po patungkol naman sa paggamit ng AI tools

asr-001889
02:06:55.020 --> 02:06:59.340
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: para matulungan ang ating mga guro at personnel.

asr-001890
02:07:00.140 --> 02:07:12.740
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Can the distinguished sponsor discuss how DepEd is using AI in detecting speech impediments and assessing health needs ng mga learners?

asr-001891
02:07:18.320 --> 02:07:21.340
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Ito po yung patungkol sa e-care.

asr-001892
02:07:25.020 --> 02:07:48.580
Rep. Maria Carmen S. Zamora: Mr. Speaker, Your Honor, there are already practices being implemented by DepEd in line with the usage of AI so as to assist our learners.

asr-001893
02:07:48.580 --> 02:07:52.580
Rep. Maria Carmen S. Zamora: So, in fact, there is one...

asr-001894
02:07:55.020 --> 02:08:07.340
Rep. Maria Carmen S. Zamora: ... one strategy that is being implemented, the taking of picture in taking the height and weight of the learner.

asr-001895
02:08:07.340 --> 02:08:14.360
Rep. Maria Carmen S. Zamora: That is one of the many AI interventions being implemented.

asr-001896
02:08:14.540 --> 02:08:15.280
Rep. Maria Carmen S. Zamora: Mr. Speaker, Your Honor.

asr-001897
02:08:16.260 --> 02:08:19.680
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Maraming salamat po, Mr. Speaker, Madam Sponsor.

asr-001898
02:08:20.360 --> 02:08:24.340
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Maari ko po bang malaman kung how much ang budget for...

asr-001899
02:08:25.020 --> 02:08:26.280
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: ... for e-care this year.

asr-001900
02:08:26.760 --> 02:08:31.180
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Is that enough to continue funding for the innovative projects?

asr-001901
02:08:36.200 --> 02:08:46.100
Rep. Maria Carmen S. Zamora: Mr. Speaker, Your Honor, with regards to AI intervention, this is also part of the wishes of the department.

asr-001902
02:08:46.100 --> 02:08:53.260
Rep. Maria Carmen S. Zamora: The department is proposing for 120 million proposal for next year.

asr-001903
02:08:53.520 --> 02:08:54.640
Rep. Maria Carmen S. Zamora: Again, it depends.

asr-001904
02:08:55.020 --> 02:08:57.440
Rep. Maria Carmen S. Zamora: It will now be subject to the approval of the government.

asr-001905
02:08:57.440 --> 02:09:00.460
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Yung this 2026 po, nasa magkano yung budget?

asr-001906
02:09:07.460 --> 02:09:15.400
Rep. Maria Carmen S. Zamora: Mr. Speaker, Your Honor, for 2026, there is an allocation of 120 million for the implementation of AI-related.

asr-001907
02:09:15.980 --> 02:09:17.000
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Maraming salamat po.

asr-001908
02:09:17.040 --> 02:09:25.000
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Ako po ay dadako ngayon sa mga katanungang gustong ipaabot ng aking kasamahan sa Akbayan na si Representative Chel Diokno.

asr-001909
02:09:25.020 --> 02:09:35.000
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: May ulat tayong natanggap mula sa isang teacher organization na wala pa rin sapat na consultation

asr-001910
02:09:35.000 --> 02:09:41.880
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: ang kagawaran sa mga stakeholders nito patungkol sa mga kamakailang policy shifts

asr-001911
02:09:41.880 --> 02:09:51.780
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: mula sa curriculum adjustment, expanded career progression system, grading system, at ang three-term school calendar system

asr-001912
02:09:51.780 --> 02:09:53.900
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: na nagdudulot ng pagkalito.

asr-001913
02:09:53.900 --> 02:10:07.780
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: At karagdagang pasanin sa ating mga kaguruan, paano po makakasiguro ng DepEd na ang mga bagong reforma at pagbabago sa sistema

asr-001914
02:10:07.780 --> 02:10:15.360
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: ay may sapat na konsultasyon sa mga guro at may katapat na pondo bago ito ipatupad sa buong bansa?

asr-001915
02:10:22.020 --> 02:10:23.200
Rep. Maria Carmen S. Zamora: Sir Speaker, Your Honor.

asr-001916
02:10:23.900 --> 02:10:30.860
Rep. Maria Carmen S. Zamora: The department actually believes only and recognizes the value of consultation.

asr-001917
02:10:31.560 --> 02:10:36.040
Rep. Maria Carmen S. Zamora: And in fact, several consultations are already being made.

asr-001918
02:10:36.540 --> 02:10:52.380
Rep. Maria Carmen S. Zamora: And in fact, there are also orientations being conducted in line with the implementation of several policies of DepEd.

asr-001919
02:10:52.380 --> 02:10:53.560
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Sige po.

asr-001920
02:10:53.900 --> 02:10:59.000
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Maaari na lang po sana na i-continue po natin yung konsultasyon na ginawa

asr-001921
02:10:59.000 --> 02:11:05.200
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: kasi baka maaari yung nagpaabot po nito sa amin or sa opisina ni Representative Chel Diokno

asr-001922
02:11:05.200 --> 02:11:08.660
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: ay hindi po sila naabutan ng konsultasyon.

asr-001923
02:11:08.900 --> 02:11:13.980
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Bago natin ipatupad ang anumang bagong calendar system or curriculum shift,

asr-001924
02:11:14.600 --> 02:11:23.780
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: naipagkaloob ba natin ang tamang orientation, pondong panturo, at sapat na pahinga para sa ating mga guro?

asr-001925
02:11:23.900 --> 02:11:33.400
Rep. Maria Carmen S. Zamora: So, Mr. Speaker, Your Honor, yes, the department is committed to reach out all stakeholders in terms of consultation

asr-001926
02:11:33.400 --> 02:11:47.980
Rep. Maria Carmen S. Zamora: so that policies and other related improvement on the program will be properly informed and spread out across all stakeholders.

asr-001927
02:11:47.980 --> 02:11:49.860
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Maraming salamat, Madam Sponsor.

asr-001928
02:11:50.060 --> 02:11:53.340
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Paano po kaya tutugunan ng DepEd ang burnout?

asr-001929
02:11:53.900 --> 02:12:01.720
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: At demoralization ng mga kawani na dulot ng paulit-ulit at bigla ang pagbabago sa mga polisiya?

asr-001930
02:12:10.440 --> 02:12:21.620
Rep. Maria Carmen S. Zamora: Mr. Speaker, Your Honor, there are several interventions also being done by DepEd as to ensure the wellness of our teachers.

asr-001931
02:12:21.620 --> 02:12:31.060
Rep. Maria Carmen S. Zamora: In fact, just last week, the department announced for the wellness break, two-day wellness break of our teachers.

asr-001932
02:12:31.240 --> 02:12:40.900
Rep. Maria Carmen S. Zamora: These are just one of the many interventions being made to ensure wellness among teachers and other personnel of DepEd.

asr-001933
02:12:41.260 --> 02:12:41.960
Rep. Maria Carmen S. Zamora: Mr. Speaker, Your Honor.

asr-001934
02:12:42.080 --> 02:12:50.120
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Maraming salamat po. Actually, nalaman ko po itong wellness dahil ang kapatid ko po ay isang DepEd teacher at nag-wellness na rin po siya.

asr-001935
02:12:50.120 --> 02:12:51.540
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Kaya maraming salamat.

asr-001936
02:12:51.620 --> 02:12:53.360
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Ipagpatuloy po natin ito.

asr-001937
02:12:53.600 --> 02:13:10.240
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: In closing po, Mr. Speaker, Distinguished Sponsor, ang ating mga guro ang nagsisilbing pangalawang magulang ng ating mga mag-aaral na nagbibigay hindi lamang ng karunungan kundi ng kalinga sa ating mga kabataan.

asr-001938
02:13:10.240 --> 02:13:21.420
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Ang bawat biglaang pagbabago sa sistema, kawalan ng konsultasyon at kulang na suporta ay hindi lamang pabigat sa kanila kundi pagbibigo rin.

asr-001939
02:13:21.620 --> 02:13:33.400
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Sa mga batang kanilang inaalagaan, I urge my colleagues na huwag ipagkait sa ating mga guro at personel ang nararapat na pondo at pahinga. Maraming salamat po.

asr-001940
02:13:35.200 --> 02:13:36.740
Deputy Speaker Francisco Paolo P. Ortega V: Thank you, Honorable Ismula.

asr-001941
02:13:37.940 --> 02:13:47.660
Rep. Alyssa Michaela "Mica" M. Gonzales: Mr. Speaker, next to interpellate the sponsor, I move to recognize Representative Sergio Dagooc of party-list APEC.

asr-001942
02:13:48.500 --> 02:13:50.960
Deputy Speaker Francisco Paolo P. Ortega V: The Honorable Dagooc is now recognized. You may proceed, sir.

asr-001943
02:14:03.300 --> 02:14:05.200
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Thank you, Mr. Speaker. Thank you, Majority Leader.

asr-001944
02:14:05.200 --> 02:14:21.440
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Mayong bontag sa ating sponsor, pinakagwapa ng representante sa Mindanao, sa ating sekretary, at sa lahat ng mga bumubuo ng Department of Education, magandang umaga po.

asr-001945
