asr-002834
03:05:17.920 --> 03:05:19.880
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: for 10 years,

asr-002835
03:05:20.560 --> 03:05:24.640
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: eh lamalabas 160 billion pesos per year.

asr-002836
03:05:24.660 --> 03:05:25.800
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: Ang kailangan po natin.

asr-002837
03:05:26.340 --> 03:05:28.760
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: Pero 10 years po yun.

asr-002838
03:05:29.040 --> 03:05:31.680
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: At purely po sa conversion

asr-002839
03:05:32.380 --> 03:05:34.500
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: na maging irrigable land ho siya.

asr-002840
03:05:34.880 --> 03:05:36.220
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: Pwera pa po yung restoration,

asr-002841
03:05:36.980 --> 03:05:38.280
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: pwera pa po yung improvements,

asr-002842
03:05:38.760 --> 03:05:40.160
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: at pwera pa rin yung repair.

asr-002843
03:05:40.580 --> 03:05:42.300
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: Mr. Speaker, Distinguished Colleagues.

asr-002844
03:05:43.740 --> 03:05:47.120
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Mr. Speaker, mahalaga ang nabanggit ng ating distinguished sponsor.

asr-002845
03:05:47.340 --> 03:05:48.960
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Dahil noong 2024 nga,

asr-002846
03:05:49.040 --> 03:05:51.040
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: sinabi nyo na po sa kapulungan na ito,

asr-002847
03:05:51.040 --> 03:05:54.300
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: na nasa 200 billion pesos kada taon.

asr-002848
03:05:54.660 --> 03:05:56.280
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Sa mga susunod na taon,

asr-002849
03:05:56.540 --> 03:06:04.000
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: ang kinakailangan para ma-cover ang pan-irrigated land sa buong bansa.

asr-002850
03:06:04.500 --> 03:06:07.580
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: At sa ngayon, wala pa po sa 25%

asr-002851
03:06:07.580 --> 03:06:10.380
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: ng kinakailangan na annual requirement

asr-002852
03:06:10.380 --> 03:06:14.360
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: ang nilalaan para sa pondo ng NIA.

asr-002853
03:06:15.380 --> 03:06:16.300
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Sa ngayon po ba,

asr-002854
03:06:17.620 --> 03:06:20.340
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: ilang ektarya yung kasalukuyang service area

asr-002855
03:06:20.340 --> 03:06:24.140
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: na talagang productive at actively cultivated?

asr-002856
03:06:24.660 --> 03:06:28.020
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: At ilang hektars po ang hindi nagagamit ng husto

asr-002857
03:06:28.020 --> 03:06:31.380
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: dahil sa kakulangan na halimbawa ng water supply?

asr-002858
03:06:33.340 --> 03:06:34.940
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ilan po dito sa kasalukuyang

asr-002859
03:06:34.940 --> 03:06:37.960
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: ang sakop ng mga small irrigation projects?

asr-002860
03:06:39.980 --> 03:06:41.880
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: Mr. Speaker, Distinguished Colleagues,

asr-002861
03:06:42.380 --> 03:06:48.540
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: actually, yung dati kasi potential na 2.2 million hektars natin,

asr-002862
03:06:49.280 --> 03:06:50.780
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: ay datos pa po yun noon.

asr-002863
03:06:51.540 --> 03:06:53.040
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: Pero kung titignan po natin talaga,

asr-002864
03:06:53.180 --> 03:06:54.220
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: minus, minus, minus,

asr-002865
03:06:54.220 --> 03:06:56.020
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: yung mga development alongside,

asr-002866
03:06:57.160 --> 03:07:01.160
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: ay andyan ho yung development ng pabahay,

asr-002867
03:07:01.280 --> 03:07:03.400
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: conversion ng maging industrial,

asr-002868
03:07:03.660 --> 03:07:04.860
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: ng non-agricultural,

asr-002869
03:07:05.720 --> 03:07:09.340
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: yung hundo-punto natin ay talaga hong nakakalungkot isipin

asr-002870
03:07:09.340 --> 03:07:11.160
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: na talaga hong bumababa.

asr-002871
03:07:11.280 --> 03:07:13.620
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: Instead na ma-maintain natin at tumaas pa sana,

asr-002872
03:07:14.240 --> 03:07:16.060
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: ang nangyayari ho talaga ay pababa.

asr-002873
03:07:16.260 --> 03:07:19.220
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: Pero hindi naman na ho natin matatawaran yung

asr-002874
03:07:19.820 --> 03:07:22.180
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: tumadating kasi ang pagkakataon

asr-002875
03:07:22.180 --> 03:07:23.680
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: na dumadami yung tao,

asr-002876
03:07:24.220 --> 03:07:26.460
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: nagkakaroon ng improvement, suma-asenso,

asr-002877
03:07:27.080 --> 03:07:29.220
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: talaga hong nagkakaroon ng conversions.

asr-002878
03:07:30.500 --> 03:07:33.700
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: So, lalo't higit doon ho sa mga national highway

asr-002879
03:07:33.700 --> 03:07:36.100
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: na naka-perpendicular sa highway,

asr-002880
03:07:36.340 --> 03:07:39.180
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: talaga hong automatic na ho yun na nai-co-convert.

asr-002881
03:07:39.680 --> 03:07:41.380
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: Although siya ay irrigated land.

asr-002882
03:07:41.820 --> 03:07:43.640
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: Maliba lang siyempre doon sa mga sulok-sulok,

asr-002883
03:07:43.780 --> 03:07:47.080
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: talaga hong yun na talagang pinag-uusapan natin mabuti

asr-002884
03:07:47.080 --> 03:07:49.080
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: na dapat maiwasan siya.

asr-002885
03:07:49.640 --> 03:07:50.720
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: Kasi otherwise,

asr-002886
03:07:51.660 --> 03:07:52.840
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: mangyayari ho dyan,

asr-002887
03:07:53.100 --> 03:07:54.060
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: kasos tayo ng gaso,

asr-002888
03:07:54.060 --> 03:07:55.920
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: pero sa dulo,

asr-002889
03:07:56.800 --> 03:07:58.540
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: eh convert naman sila ng convert.

asr-002890
03:07:59.020 --> 03:08:03.080
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: So, kung mabalikan ho natin yung talagang natatamdan,

asr-002891
03:08:03.360 --> 03:08:06.060
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: out of the 2.2 million hectares,

asr-002892
03:08:06.780 --> 03:08:09.740
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: eh ni-research po nga natin kagabi,

asr-002893
03:08:10.560 --> 03:08:12.160
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: eh kung yamang tignan,

asr-002894
03:08:12.360 --> 03:08:13.940
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: i-obserbahan natin mabuti ho,

asr-002895
03:08:14.140 --> 03:08:15.480
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: at tatanungin natin mabuti rin,

asr-002896
03:08:15.900 --> 03:08:18.560
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: ang naka-convert neto ay almost

asr-002897
03:08:18.560 --> 03:08:20.220
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: nasa 50,000,

asr-002898
03:08:20.320 --> 03:08:21.180
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: kung ano nagkakamali,

asr-002899
03:08:21.800 --> 03:08:23.120
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: eh mauubos talaga.

asr-002900
03:08:23.120 --> 03:08:23.800
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: Pero

asr-002901
03:08:23.800 --> 03:08:25.060
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: ang talagang bilang ho,

asr-002902
03:08:25.060 --> 03:08:27.060
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: base sa datos na natin ngayon,

asr-002903
03:08:27.060 --> 03:08:31.060
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: yung pinakamalinis na napapatubigan

asr-002904
03:08:31.060 --> 03:08:39.060
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: ay nasa almost 1.5 million hectares na lampo.

asr-002905
03:08:39.060 --> 03:08:41.060
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: Eh ngayon,

asr-002906
03:08:41.060 --> 03:08:42.060
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: kaya yan,

asr-002907
03:08:42.060 --> 03:08:43.060
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: isa nang talagang usapin,

asr-002908
03:08:43.060 --> 03:08:44.060
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: Mr. Speaker,

asr-002909
03:08:44.060 --> 03:08:45.060
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: Distinguished Colleague,

asr-002910
03:08:45.060 --> 03:08:47.060
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: na dapat talaga maiwasan natin

asr-002911
03:08:47.060 --> 03:08:50.060
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: yung walang pakundangang conversion.

asr-002912
03:08:50.060 --> 03:08:51.060
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: Otherwise,

asr-002913
03:08:51.060 --> 03:08:54.060
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: gumagastos tayo sa kaliwang kamay,

asr-002914
03:08:54.060 --> 03:08:57.060
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: at ito naman ay nanguubos

asr-002915
03:08:57.060 --> 03:09:00.060
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: ng ating mga irrigated

asr-002916
03:09:00.060 --> 03:09:01.060
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: or erigible land,

asr-002917
03:09:01.060 --> 03:09:04.060
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: Mr. Speaker, Distinguished Colleagues.

asr-002918
03:09:04.060 --> 03:09:06.060
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Mr. Speaker, Distinguished Sponsor,

asr-002919
03:09:06.060 --> 03:09:09.060
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: ang representasyon ho na ito ay nananawagan din

asr-002920
03:09:09.060 --> 03:09:13.060
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: na dapat mas mahigpit itong mga gabay natin,

asr-002921
03:09:13.060 --> 03:09:16.060
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: mga palisya na may kinalaman sa land use conversion.

asr-002922
03:09:16.060 --> 03:09:17.060
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Dahil tama ho kayo,

asr-002923
03:09:17.060 --> 03:09:21.060
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: napakabilis po halimbawa ng expansion

asr-002924
03:09:21.060 --> 03:09:23.060
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: ng iba't ibang industrial projects.

asr-002925
03:09:23.060 --> 03:09:26.060
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Sa maraming mga lugar kung saan

asr-002926
03:09:26.060 --> 03:09:29.060
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: productive ang agricultural lands

asr-002927
03:09:29.060 --> 03:09:32.060
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: at meron pang natala na dun sa bahagi

asr-002928
03:09:32.060 --> 03:09:34.060
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: ng mga prime agricultural lands.

asr-002929
03:09:34.060 --> 03:09:35.060
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Sa kasalukuyan,

asr-002930
03:09:35.060 --> 03:09:37.060
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: kulang na kulang po yung proteksyon natin

asr-002931
03:09:37.060 --> 03:09:39.060
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: sa ating mga prime agricultural lands

asr-002932
03:09:39.060 --> 03:09:42.060
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: para matiyak hindi lang po yung

asr-002933
03:09:42.060 --> 03:09:45.060
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: mismong kabuhayan ng mga nagsasaka

asr-002934
03:09:45.060 --> 03:09:49.060
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: o yung mga nagtatrabaho po sa sektor ng agrikultura,

asr-002935
03:09:49.060 --> 03:09:52.060
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: kundi matiyak din yung direksyon natin

asr-002936
03:09:52.060 --> 03:09:56.060
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: na papunta sa food self-sufficiency,

asr-002937
03:09:56.060 --> 03:09:58.060
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: lalong-lalo na sa rice self-sufficiency.

asr-002938
03:09:58.060 --> 03:09:59.060
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Dahil sa ngayon,

asr-002939
03:09:59.060 --> 03:10:03.060
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: napakataas na po talaga ng ating food import dependence,

asr-002940
03:10:03.060 --> 03:10:08.060
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: lalong-lalo na dun sa ating mga pangunahin na pagkain,

asr-002941
03:10:08.060 --> 03:10:11.060
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: tulad ng bigas, tulad ng mais.

asr-002942
03:10:11.060 --> 03:10:14.060
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ayan po ang kasalukuyang nakalagayan.

asr-002943
03:10:14.060 --> 03:10:16.060
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Kaya po sa ganyang sitwasyon,

asr-002944
03:10:16.060 --> 03:10:20.060
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: meron bang aktibo na tulungan ang Department of Agrarian Reform

asr-002945
03:10:20.060 --> 03:10:22.060
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: at ang NIA

asr-002946
03:10:22.060 --> 03:10:27.060
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: sa pagtitiyak ng proteksyon ng ating prime agricultural lands

asr-002947
03:10:27.060 --> 03:10:31.060
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: at natitiyak natin na yung mga lugar na service area ng NIA,

asr-002948
03:10:31.060 --> 03:10:35.060
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: meron tayong aktibo na irrigation projects

asr-002949
03:10:35.060 --> 03:10:38.060
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: ay nape-preserba natin at napoprotektahan.

asr-002950
03:10:39.260 --> 03:10:42.060
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: Mr. Speaker, District Colleague,

asr-002951
03:10:42.060 --> 03:10:45.060
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: tama po lahat ng sinabi nating kasamahan dito.

asr-002952
03:10:45.060 --> 03:10:48.060
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: Totoo yan kasi sa pag-convert natin,

asr-002953
03:10:48.060 --> 03:10:53.060
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: totoo yan kasi sa pag-convert ng isang pabahay,

asr-002954
03:10:53.060 --> 03:10:57.060
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: alimbawa man, o may convert into non-agricultural,

asr-002955
03:10:57.060 --> 03:11:03.060
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: eh ang ahensyang involved po dyan bago siyang maging ganap na mabigyan ng clearance

asr-002956
03:11:03.060 --> 03:11:10.060
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: ay ang DAR, ang DA, at ang NIA, at ang LGU.

asr-002957
03:11:10.060 --> 03:11:14.060
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: Kaya maganda po talaga na higpitan natin sapagkat gumagastos nga tayo,

asr-002958
03:11:14.060 --> 03:11:17.060
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: tapos sila naman ay patuloy na nagko-convert,

asr-002959
03:11:17.060 --> 03:11:20.060
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: lalo't higit doon naman sa,

asr-002960
03:11:20.060 --> 03:11:23.060
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: kasi nga katotong sinabi ko nga po kanina,

asr-002961
03:11:23.060 --> 03:11:27.060
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: doon ho sa mga national highway,

asr-002962
03:11:27.060 --> 03:11:32.060
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: primary, secondary, tertiary, talagang ma-automatic na conversion.

asr-002963
03:11:32.060 --> 03:11:39.060
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: Pero doon ho sa mga sulok-sulok na magandaanid dahil sa malakas ng tubig,

asr-002964
03:11:39.060 --> 03:11:44.060
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: tapos kinoconvert ng walang pakundangan, eh yun ho ang nakakabahala,

asr-002965
03:11:44.060 --> 03:11:46.060
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: Mr. Speaker, District Colleague.

asr-002966
03:11:47.060 --> 03:11:49.060
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: Kaya tama lang po na yu po.

asr-002967
03:11:49.060 --> 03:11:53.060
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: At ito'y napag-usapan na rin naman po bago pa dumating tong puntong ito,

asr-002968
03:11:53.060 --> 03:12:00.060
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: sa pagkakatong ito, na dapat talaga ay yu pong mabuti at higpitan ang pagko-convert.

asr-002969
03:12:00.060 --> 03:12:02.060
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: Tapagkat hindi ho gawang biro.

asr-002970
03:12:02.060 --> 03:12:08.060
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: Yung gastusin ng NIA kahit dasal tayo ng dasal na madagdagan ng pondo,

asr-002971
03:12:08.060 --> 03:12:12.060
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: dito naman sa bandang kaliwa natin, convert sila ng convert,

asr-002972
03:12:12.060 --> 03:12:15.060
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: wala naman problema kung talagang ang slope ng, ah, ah, no,

asr-002973
03:12:15.060 --> 03:12:21.060
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: ng lupa ay imposibleng malagyan ng tubig.

asr-002974
03:12:21.060 --> 03:12:29.060
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: Kung lalampas siya ng halimbawang 18% o percent slope o kaya 20% slope,

asr-002975
03:12:29.060 --> 03:12:31.060
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: medyo mahirap-hirap na ho yun.

asr-002976
03:12:31.060 --> 03:12:36.060
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: At ang maganda naman ho doon, pag yun ang binigyan natin ng clearance,

asr-002977
03:12:36.060 --> 03:12:38.060
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: eh sa cut and fill na lang ho sila gagastus.

asr-002978
03:12:38.060 --> 03:12:44.060
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: Unlike doon sa mga lugar na malalalim, eh mag-gastus din ho yun.

asr-002979
03:12:44.060 --> 03:12:47.060
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: Kung anong halaga ng per square meter noon, pag tinambangan mo yun,

asr-002980
03:12:47.060 --> 03:12:49.060
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: yun din ang halaga ng cost.

asr-002981
03:12:49.060 --> 03:12:54.060
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: Kaya hindi naman ho magiging lugi rin yung magko-convert kung saka-sakali man,

asr-002982
03:12:54.060 --> 03:12:56.060
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: Mr. Speaker, Distinguished Colleagues.

asr-002983
03:12:56.630 --> 03:13:02.060
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Mr. Speaker, sino po ang pangunahing namamahala dyan sa pagtitiyak ng,

asr-002984
03:13:02.060 --> 03:13:11.060
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: na kumbaga, ah, may, ah, hindi lang tama eh pero mahusay po na koordinasyon hinggil sa, ah,

asr-002985
03:13:11.060 --> 03:13:12.060
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: mga usapin ng irrigation projects.

asr-002986
03:13:12.060 --> 03:13:19.060
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Vis-a-vis, ah, the application of a land use conversion.

asr-002987
03:13:20.130 --> 03:13:31.060
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: Ah, Mr. Speaker, Distinguished Colleagues, yung humang tinukurukuin natin ay yung primary na ahensya na mag-maga-ko-convert.

asr-002988
03:13:31.060 --> 03:13:33.060
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: Kasama ho pa pala ang DHSUD, nakalimutan ko sabihin.

asr-002989
03:13:33.060 --> 03:13:40.060
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: Kasi sila yung huling pipirma kung sa individual land titling, kung pasado ho ba yung, ah, mapa o, ah, land use conversion.

asr-002990
03:13:40.060 --> 03:13:46.060
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: limitong lahat nong ah, mapa o yung pinaka, ah, site development, ah, plan.

asr-002991
03:13:46.060 --> 03:13:49.060
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: Pero most importantly talaga ang LGU.

asr-002992
03:13:49.060 --> 03:13:58.060
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: Kasi ang LGU po ang Local Government Unit sila hamak ang nakakaalam nung mga area na dine-ide, indevelop.

asr-002993
03:13:58.060 --> 03:14:05.140
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: Sahabat at minsan pag napapabayaan din ho ng, nang LGU, nga lang sa, sa planning, no.

asr-002994
03:14:05.140 --> 03:14:09.580
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: Sa mga kanila mga CPTO, kayang municipal planning officer.

asr-002995
03:14:10.060 --> 03:14:15.100
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: Basta okay lang sila na okay, at the end of the day, hindi pala sila magtatambak.

asr-002996
03:14:16.280 --> 03:14:23.840
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: Sa dulo, pag bumaha, nagkaroon ng problema, ang sinisisi po lagi LGO.

asr-002997
03:14:23.840 --> 03:14:39.680
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: Kaya dapat to talaga magsama-sama na ho yung nabanggit nating ahensya na iyo pong mabuti, paigtingin mabuti at ipataw or implement ang law para sa bagay na napag-usapan po natin, Mr. Speaker of the District College.

asr-002998
03:14:40.470 --> 03:15:00.000
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Mahalaga po ito, Mr. Speaker, Distinguished Sponsor, dahil marami na dito sa kapulungan natin sa 20th Congress na mga panukalang batas para proteksyonan at mapreserba at yung kinakailangan ng mga support services sa agrikultura na kaugnay ng...

asr-002999
03:15:00.000 --> 03:15:03.560
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: proteksyon ng ating mga prime agricultural lands

asr-003000
03:15:03.560 --> 03:15:06.660
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: at paghihigpit pagdating sa mga land use conversion.

asr-003001
03:15:07.220 --> 03:15:13.520
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Dahil kung gano'n po kabilis yung expansion halimbawa ng mga industrial projects,

asr-003002
03:15:13.520 --> 03:15:20.200
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: gayon naman po kabagal at sobrang lumiliit pa yung mga sakop ng ating mga lupain

asr-003003
03:15:20.200 --> 03:15:22.840
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: na ginagamit para sa agrikultura.

asr-003004
03:15:23.220 --> 03:15:28.740
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Napakalaki muli ng impact nito, hindi lang po sa pagkain, sa presyo din ng pagkain.

asr-003005
03:15:28.740 --> 03:15:40.800
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: At sa pangkabuan, yung nutrisyon at yung pag-commit ng tamang requirements

asr-003006
03:15:40.800 --> 03:15:43.180
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: para sa pagkain ng ating mga kababayan.

asr-003007
03:15:43.600 --> 03:15:46.800
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Sa panahon na milyon-milyon pa rin po yung ating hungry poor na Filipinos,

asr-003008
03:15:47.620 --> 03:15:49.820
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: gano'n po kahalaga ang sektor ng agrikultura.

asr-003009
03:15:50.000 --> 03:15:56.540
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Kaya nga po nais kong tanungin, ang sabi rin po sa budget message para sa fiscal year 2027,

asr-003010
03:15:57.000 --> 03:15:58.680
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: may tatlong bagay na priority.

asr-003011
03:15:58.740 --> 03:16:07.840
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Yung education, yung kalusugan, tapos lagi pong binabanggit ang support sa sektor ng agrikultura.

asr-003012
03:16:08.340 --> 03:16:11.680
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Kung tunay po na prioridad ang sektor ng agrikultura,

asr-003013
03:16:11.880 --> 03:16:20.560
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: bakit po ito yung nakikita natin na pagkaliit-liit na binibigay na pondo para sa irrigation?

asr-003014
03:16:20.560 --> 03:16:23.540
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: At nais ko na rin pong banggitin ang ginaong speaker,

asr-003015
03:16:24.120 --> 03:16:28.560
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: very alarming po na yung subsidy for national irrigation systems

asr-003016
03:16:28.740 --> 03:16:29.340
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: and communal irrigation systems

asr-003017
03:16:29.340 --> 03:16:40.040
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: meron pong nasa 21 billion na budget cut at ganyan din po sa subsidy for small irrigation projects.

asr-003018
03:16:40.320 --> 03:16:48.680
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Halos para na po natin sinara itong programa na ito dahil ang kaltas po nila nasa 1.95 billion.

asr-003019
03:16:49.100 --> 03:16:54.440
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: At napakaliit ng pondo na matitira para dito.

asr-003020
03:16:54.440 --> 03:16:58.720
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Maari po bang magbigay ng pahayag ang ating distinguished sponsor?

asr-003021
03:16:58.740 --> 03:17:03.440
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Bakit ganito po ang kalagayan ng binibigay natin na pondo?

asr-003022
03:17:04.760 --> 03:17:10.140
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Hindi lang po ito sa niya, ginaong speaker, pero nakita rin po natin sa DA na ganito din po ang nangyari.

asr-003023
03:17:10.860 --> 03:17:19.920
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Malaki ang kaltas pondo na inaasahan natin na magpapalala ng sitwasyon ng ating bansa.

asr-003024
03:17:20.560 --> 03:17:24.180
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Yung kontibusyon po ngayon ng agriculture sa GDP natin,

asr-003025
03:17:24.660 --> 03:17:28.060
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: nasa pinakamababa sa ating kasaysayan, nasa 1.8%.

asr-003026
03:17:28.740 --> 03:17:31.660
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Kung magpapatuloy yung ganitong trend na puro tayo budget cuts,

asr-003027
03:17:32.040 --> 03:17:39.660
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: mahirapan po tayo na tunay na paunla rin ang lokal na produksyon sa agrikultura dito sa ating bansa.

asr-003028
03:17:41.220 --> 03:17:45.440
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: Mr. Speaker, Distinguished Colleague, tama po kayo.

asr-003029
03:17:46.160 --> 03:17:56.060
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: Actually, para maging ganap na meron tayong food security,

asr-003030
03:17:56.060 --> 03:18:07.520
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: ang talagang hong pondo na nire-request ng ahensya ay P232B na intended yan sa pag-develop ng eredible land

asr-003031
03:18:07.520 --> 03:18:12.400
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: at sempre dun din sa mga restorations and improvements and repair.

asr-003032
03:18:13.020 --> 03:18:21.900
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: Kasi hindi naman natin maiwasan na talagang may bagyo, may earthquake, mayroong mga disaster o man-made disaster.

asr-003033
03:18:21.900 --> 03:18:22.180
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: Hindi.

asr-003034
03:18:23.380 --> 03:18:25.600
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: Ack of God na disaster.

asr-003035
03:18:26.060 --> 03:18:27.360
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: Mayroong nagkakaroon ng pagsira.

asr-003036
03:18:28.240 --> 03:18:29.320
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: Kasabay ho yan.

asr-003037
03:18:29.800 --> 03:18:32.160
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: May ginagawa tayo, nire-restore natin to.

asr-003038
03:18:32.680 --> 03:18:34.280
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: Mas mura naman kasi hamak yun.

asr-003039
03:18:35.160 --> 03:18:39.680
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: Kaya lahat ho na napag-uusapan po natin, kakibat po rin talaga,

asr-003040
03:18:40.200 --> 03:18:46.740
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: yung magkaroon ng additional funding para hamak na matulungan ho natin at hindi tayo maging import dependent.

asr-003041
03:18:47.280 --> 03:18:47.860
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: Yun ho yun.

asr-003042
03:18:47.860 --> 03:18:51.240
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: Kaya maganda man ho ang ating,

asr-003043
03:18:52.860 --> 03:18:54.300
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: bagamat ang sabi nga natin,

asr-003044
03:18:54.300 --> 03:19:00.820
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: dahil sa limited fiscal space po tayo at sa dami naman po nang nangangailangan din na ahensya,

asr-003045
03:19:01.300 --> 03:19:06.540
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: eh talaga naman hong binabahabahagi na lang po.

asr-003046
03:19:06.700 --> 03:19:10.640
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: At yun naman isadyang ginagawa naman ng NIA ay binabatak-batak na lang ho

asr-003047
03:19:10.640 --> 03:19:20.080
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: at talagang hindi man mabigyan lahat, at least yung mapagbigyan at sa susunod mapagbigyan yung iba at sa susunod naman mapagbigyan.

asr-003048
03:19:20.720 --> 03:19:24.220
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: Ang mahirap lang ho sa pondo kasi ng NIA, Mr. Speaker,

asr-003049
03:19:24.300 --> 03:19:25.260
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: Distinguished Colleague,

asr-003050
03:19:25.800 --> 03:19:34.960
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: na talaga ho naman kasi pagpira-piraso natin yung mga malalaking big ticket project, legacy project,

asr-003051
03:19:35.600 --> 03:19:38.340
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: instead na magamit natin sa maigsing panahon.

asr-003052
03:19:38.500 --> 03:19:40.080
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: Kasi may mga multi-year funding,

asr-003053
03:19:40.900 --> 03:19:49.360
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: meron kasing malalaking dams na pwedeng magpatubig ng 30,000, 40,000,

asr-003054
03:19:49.360 --> 03:19:54.060
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: pero dahil nga naman marami rin nang hihingi sa atin sa,

asr-003055
03:19:54.300 --> 03:19:58.600
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: sa buong Pilipinas ng pondo, eh talaga ho pinipira-piraso rin.

asr-003056
03:19:58.760 --> 03:20:02.440
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: So nangyayari doon sa malalaking big ticket, so natin medyo naantala konti.

asr-003057
03:20:03.180 --> 03:20:08.100
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: Pero kung yun ho talaga nakafocus tayo doon at gusto natin talaga magpatubig na mas marami,

asr-003058
03:20:08.660 --> 03:20:15.340
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: talagang ho yung mga big tickets katulad ng Tumawini, katulad doon sa Ilocos,

asr-003059
03:20:15.760 --> 03:20:19.600
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: na talaga ho malalaki ho ang pwedeng mapatubigan doon.

asr-003060
03:20:21.300 --> 03:20:24.060
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: Kaya yun, ang panawagan din siyempre natin,

asr-003061
03:20:24.060 --> 03:20:28.240
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: na madagdagan talaga ang pondo ng National Irrigation Office.

asr-003062
03:20:28.600 --> 03:20:30.440
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: Mr. Speaker, Distinguished Colleagues.

asr-003063
03:20:31.660 --> 03:20:37.060
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Bilang huli po, Mr. Speaker, magkano doon sa 232 billion na original proposal

asr-003064
03:20:37.060 --> 03:20:42.980
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: ang para sa communal irrigation systems at para sa small irrigation projects?

asr-003065
03:20:43.280 --> 03:20:47.200
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Sa bahagi po kasi ng representasyon na ito at marami na rin namang pag-aaral

asr-003066
03:20:47.200 --> 03:20:53.440
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: at maaari nating maireserba para sa mas malawak pa na diskusyon sa ating Committee on Agriculture,

asr-003067
03:20:54.060 --> 03:20:59.640
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: yung tungkol din po sa impact halimbawa ng binabanggit ninyo na mga mega dams,

asr-003068
03:20:59.720 --> 03:21:05.580
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: mga big ticket projects versus itong mga communal at small irrigation projects.

asr-003069
03:21:05.700 --> 03:21:12.500
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Sa ngayon po, ang suporta ng aming representasyon ay doon sa ating mga communal irrigation systems

asr-003070
03:21:12.500 --> 03:21:14.840
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: at mga small irrigation projects.

asr-003071
03:21:14.840 --> 03:21:19.880
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Kaya po, pwede nyo lang po masabi for the record kung magkano po yung original proposal

asr-003072
03:21:19.880 --> 03:21:23.840
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: for the small irrigation projects at para sa communal irrigation.

asr-003073
03:21:24.060 --> 03:21:25.320
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: So, irrigation systems.

asr-003074
03:21:28.400 --> 03:21:37.120
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: Base po sa pagkakaintindi po natin, more or less doon sa restoration, assuming na 232 billion po siya,

asr-003075
03:21:37.760 --> 03:21:42.820
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: kung sa restoration and improvements and repair, mga 60 billion something po siya

asr-003076
03:21:42.820 --> 03:21:49.660
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: and all the rest para sa generation na po ng bagong patubig, Mr. Speaker, Distinguished Colleague.

asr-003077
03:21:50.220 --> 03:21:52.820
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Mr. Speaker, hingi na lang po natin yung breakdown

asr-003078
03:21:52.820 --> 03:21:53.340
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: nitong

asr-003079
03:21:53.340 --> 03:21:54.400
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: original proposal

asr-003080
03:21:54.400 --> 03:21:56.260
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: from NIA.

asr-003081
03:21:56.560 --> 03:22:02.100
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: At muli, sinusuportahan po natin yung pagtataas ng pondo para sa communal irrigation systems

asr-003082
03:22:02.100 --> 03:22:11.260
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: at saka sa small irrigation projects na tiyak po natin na pinakamakakarating at makakatulong sa ating mga magsasaka sa buong bansa.

asr-003083
03:22:11.660 --> 03:22:14.820
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Maraming salamat, Mr. Speaker. Maraming salamat sa ating distinguished sponsor.

asr-003084
03:22:15.460 --> 03:22:18.700
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: Thank you, Mr. Speaker, Distinguished Colleague. Maraming salamat din.

asr-003085
03:22:30.760 --> 03:22:31.440
Deputy Speaker Francisco Paolo P. Ortega V: Majority Leader.

asr-003087
03:22:37.580 --> 03:22:47.180
Rep. Patricia C. Calderon: Mr. Speaker, next to interpellate the sponsor, I move to recognize Representative Percy Cendaña of Akbayan Party-list.

asr-003088
03:22:47.380 --> 03:22:48.860
Deputy Speaker Francisco Paolo P. Ortega V: Honorable Cendaña is now recognized.

asr-003089
03:22:50.700 --> 03:22:52.800
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Magandang tanghali po, Ginong Speaker.

asr-003090
03:22:52.800 --> 03:22:59.480
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: At magandang tanghali po sa ating ginagalang na sponsor ng budget ng NIA, Representative Joseph Tan.

asr-003091
03:22:59.980 --> 03:23:02.560
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: At magandang umaga po sa buong NIA family.

asr-003092
03:23:04.140 --> 03:23:10.600
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Isa po siguro sa mga ahensya na hindi ko narinig ang matinding pagdaing noong budget briefing ay ang NIA.

asr-003093
03:23:10.800 --> 03:23:14.940
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Kasi if I understand correctly, may increase po sa ating budget.

asr-003094
03:23:15.380 --> 03:23:22.100
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Maari po bang malaman magkano po yung nadagdag sa ating budget as proposed for 2027 compared po to 2026?

asr-003095
03:23:22.800 --> 03:23:23.560
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: ...

asr-003096
03:23:26.280 --> 03:23:32.680
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: Mr. Speaker, Distinguished Colleagues, ang tinitok po po natin ay yung karagdagan.

asr-003097
03:23:33.220 --> 03:23:43.960
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: Actually, Mr. Speaker, Distinguished Colleague Nom, ang amount na original proposed funding ay P232 billion.

asr-003098
03:23:44.580 --> 03:23:49.320
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: Pero lumabas lang po na NEP ay nasa P46 billion something.

asr-003099
03:23:49.520 --> 03:23:52.680
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: Plus yung hong local source po.

asr-003100
03:23:52.800 --> 03:23:59.540
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: So, ang total po niyan ay almost 47 billion pesos po lang po, Mr. Speaker, Distinguished Colleagues.

asr-003101
03:24:00.420 --> 03:24:02.900
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Maraming salamat, Distinguished Colleagues, Mr. Speaker.

asr-003102
03:24:03.820 --> 03:24:09.560
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Mabilis lamang po ang ilang mga tanong. Una po ay, pausapan po natin ang 2026 budget po natin.

asr-003103
03:24:10.060 --> 03:24:16.140
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Magkano na po ang obligated at disbursed ating 2026 budget ginaong sponsor, Mr. Speaker?

asr-003104
03:24:16.140 --> 03:24:34.600
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: Sa 2026 po, ang utilization rate po natin ay more or less 49% at ang disbursement rate po natin ay 28%.

asr-003105
03:24:34.600 --> 03:24:45.880
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: So, nangyari po ito kasi kung babalikan po natin ang datos, kasi po yung lumabas po na,

asr-003106
03:24:46.140 --> 03:24:54.040
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: advice o saraw from DBM ay medyo late po siya, middle of the year more or less,

asr-003107
03:24:54.140 --> 03:24:57.720
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: na siguro sometime May or April of May.

asr-003108
03:24:58.340 --> 03:25:00.840
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: So, pag lumabas po kasi yun, dumating ang pondo,

asr-003109
03:25:01.660 --> 03:25:04.560
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: tempre, magkakaroon pa rin po ng procurement.

asr-003110
03:25:05.300 --> 03:25:10.780
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: So, it takes time. Siguro more or less po, mga two months ang procurement plus post-evaluation.

asr-003111
03:25:11.560 --> 03:25:12.600
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: So, tatlong buwan po yun.

asr-003112
03:25:12.600 --> 03:25:16.100
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: Kaya, pagkamat lumabas na yung kabuuan na pondo,

asr-003113
03:25:16.140 --> 03:25:19.720
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: eh hindi agad ma-obligate lahat yung buong pera.

asr-003114
03:25:20.420 --> 03:25:26.000
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: Kaya, lumalabas ito pala, based on sa allotment versus doon sa obligation,

asr-003115
03:25:26.740 --> 03:25:28.400
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: meron hong discrepancy malaki.

asr-003116
03:25:28.580 --> 03:25:33.800
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: Sapagkat una, yung timing ho ng pondong dumating, eh medyo sa tag-ulan na.

asr-003117
03:25:34.520 --> 03:25:37.560
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: Pangalawa, yung pondo na sa middle of the year,

asr-003118
03:25:38.040 --> 03:25:41.200
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: so yun nga, katotong sinabi ho natin, yung procurement process pa,

asr-003119
03:25:41.660 --> 03:25:45.560
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: eh talagang kumakain ho ng oras siya.

asr-003120
03:25:45.560 --> 03:25:47.560
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: At doon sa disbursement naman,

asr-003121
03:25:47.560 --> 03:25:51.560
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: sempre po, pag mababa ang patrabaho,

asr-003122
03:25:51.560 --> 03:25:53.560
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: mababa ang accomplishment,

asr-003123
03:25:53.560 --> 03:25:56.560
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: mababa rin ang collections.

asr-003124
03:25:56.560 --> 03:26:03.560
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: At sadyang causes ho na lahat ng mga delay na yan ay dahil sa nakaharap na ho tayo sa ulan.

asr-003125
03:26:03.560 --> 03:26:09.560
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: Kaya, kaliwakanan, ngayon uulan, bukas, aaraw, sa susunod na panahon ay uulan na naman.

asr-003126
03:26:09.560 --> 03:26:15.040
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: Hindi na na ho natin maintindihan kung eh ang, kung kailan talaga tunay na aaraw,

asr-003127
03:26:15.040 --> 03:26:20.040
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: sapagkat kung titignan ho natin, no, base po sa, yan nga,

asr-003128
03:26:20.040 --> 03:26:29.040
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: pag ganitong pumasok ang panahon ng June, July, August, September, October, habagat,

asr-003129
03:26:29.040 --> 03:26:34.040
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: lagi ho yang may daladalang pabugso-bugsong ulan na may bagyo pa.

asr-003130
03:26:34.040 --> 03:26:38.040
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: Kaya ang pagkakataon, ang timing ho talaga yan, pagdating sa amihan,

asr-003131
03:26:38.040 --> 03:26:44.040
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: yung itong pagdating na November, December, January, February, March, yung medyo tagtuyot ng konti, doon ho natin hinahabol.

asr-003132
03:26:44.040 --> 03:26:49.040
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: Eh nangyari ho yung panahon na yun, wala doon ho yung release,

asr-003133
03:26:49.040 --> 03:26:54.040
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: sapagkat alam naman din natin ang kadahilanan, medyo na late lang ho, pero ngayon hinahabol naman na ho,

asr-003134
03:26:54.040 --> 03:27:00.040
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: para at least lumaki ang obligations, makapag-bid out, makapag-obligate,

asr-003135
03:27:00.040 --> 03:27:07.040
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: magkaroon ng malaking physical accomplishment at lumaki rin ang disbursement, Mr. Speaker Distinguished Colleagues.

asr-003136
03:27:07.040 --> 03:27:11.040
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Mr. Speaker Distinguished Colleagues, nakababahala po iyong sitwasyon,

asr-003137
03:27:11.040 --> 03:27:13.040
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: ah, natin pagdating sa obligations.

asr-003138
03:27:14.040 --> 03:27:19.040
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: So, kung ganito po, ilan po ang mga irrigation projects natin ang delayed?

asr-003139
03:27:19.040 --> 03:27:28.040
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: Actually, may bilang din ho tayo, hindi lang, pwede yung humbig na lang namin kay Mr. Speaker Distinguished Colleagues

asr-003140
03:27:28.040 --> 03:27:33.040
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: ng kopyan ng bilang ng delay, at alam naman ho natin kasi ang mga causes ng delay,

asr-003141
03:27:33.040 --> 03:27:42.040
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: katulad na sabi nga natin, ah, kapag ganito na ho ang panahon, talaga ho, gustuhin man ng mga nananalong bidder,

asr-003142
03:27:42.040 --> 03:27:53.040
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: na mag-mobilize, dahil yung area po ay sadyang maputik na, hindi na ho yung, hindi na makagalaw totally,

asr-003143
03:27:53.040 --> 03:28:03.040
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: at kaliwakanan pa ang problema sa pag-increase ng mga fuel, scarcity ng mga gamit,

asr-003144
03:28:03.040 --> 03:28:11.040
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: ah, mga construction materials, equipment hindi ma-mobilize, kaya maraming hong causes ng delay talaga.

asr-003145
03:28:12.040 --> 03:28:20.040
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: At yan na, ang pinakahuli pa yung climate, ah, climate change, na talaga naman ho, ah, isa rin sa problema natin.

asr-003146
03:28:20.040 --> 03:28:28.040
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: Sir, ah, pero yung hinihingi po, ang nga ating butihin, Mr. Speaker, ng ating, ah, kasamahan dito ay bibigyan ho namin ka ng kopya.

asr-003147
03:28:28.040 --> 03:28:30.040
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: Sir, Speaker Distinguished Colleagues.

asr-003148
03:28:30.040 --> 03:28:36.040
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Ginong speaker, ah, ginong sponsor, asahan po natin yung pagsasubmit noong bilang ng mga irrigation projects na delayed,

asr-003149
03:28:36.040 --> 03:28:41.040
