Rep. Joseph S. Tan: Tama po, no? At narinig ko nga po yung mga para malaman natin at maproteksyonan natin ang bawat salapi ng bawat ahensya ay talagang maganda pong magkaroon tayo ng nababalik.

asr-003678
03:53:45.380 --> 03:53:47.920
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: Ipanggit po ng ating butihing kasamahan po rito.

asr-003679
03:53:48.520 --> 03:53:57.100
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: At tulad ng BP202, POW, at tulad ng coordinates, at saka itong letter of no objections.

asr-003680
03:53:57.700 --> 03:54:06.540
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: Para sa ganun maiwasan po natin yung mga overlapping at alam natin specifically na dito ilalagay at hindi po saan napupunta.

asr-003681
03:54:06.540 --> 03:54:14.960
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: At asahan niyo po na ginagawin at ginagawa na rin ng ating butihing ahensya.

asr-003682
03:54:15.380 --> 03:54:16.360
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: Mr. Speaker, Distinguished Colleague.

asr-003683
03:54:16.360 --> 03:54:27.860
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Thank you, Mr. Speaker, at sa ating kaibigan na sponsor, dahil muli po, on the record, nagko-commit ang NIA through the sponsor na dapat may ganitong mga klaseng supporting document

asr-003684
03:54:27.860 --> 03:54:35.420
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: upang matiyak natin na bawat inilalaan natin na piso sa mga proyektong irigasyon ay tunay na na-implement.

asr-003685
03:54:36.460 --> 03:54:39.160
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Babalikan ko rin po yung tanong na yan, Mr. Speaker.

asr-003686
03:54:40.260 --> 03:54:43.200
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Ngayon po, noong nakaraang budget briefing, Mr. Speaker,

asr-003687
03:54:44.380 --> 03:54:45.360
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: binabanggit po na may...

asr-003688
03:54:45.380 --> 03:54:54.920
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: may sinusundan na master plan at feasibility study bago mag-implement ng mga irrigation project, Mr. Speaker.

asr-003689
03:54:55.880 --> 03:55:06.780
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Ngayon, ito pong master plan at feasibility study, by the word itself, ito ang magiging gabay para i-address yung ilang mga importanteng katanungan.

asr-003690
03:55:06.780 --> 03:55:13.780
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Halimbawa, ilan yung irrigable lands, ilan yung mga non-irrigated, ilan yung annual targets,

asr-003691
03:55:15.380 --> 03:55:20.960
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: kasi nagpa-plano tayo, di ba, humihingi tayo ng pondo, nagpa-plano tayo,

asr-003692
03:55:21.300 --> 03:55:29.320
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: at binanggit nga po ng ahensya na ang target pa nila ay 30% na ma-irrigate.

asr-003693
03:55:29.460 --> 03:55:30.660
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Tama po ba ito, Mr. Speaker?

asr-003694
03:55:35.580 --> 03:55:38.100
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: Mr. Speaker, this is colleague.

asr-003695
03:55:38.100 --> 03:55:42.340
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: Yung 30% po ay base sa mga non-irrigable land pa.

asr-003696
03:55:42.940 --> 03:55:44.100
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: Kasi po, kung...

asr-003697
03:55:45.380 --> 03:55:52.280
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: Titignan po natin yung pondong 3.2, ay yung land area na 3.2 million hectares.

asr-003698
03:55:53.060 --> 03:56:01.120
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: Ang 70% po nun ay na-develop na, although, andun po kasi yung sinabi natin kanina na nagkaroon po ng mga deductions

asr-003699
03:56:01.120 --> 03:56:07.100
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: dahil sa mga housing or non-agricultural development.

asr-003700
03:56:07.700 --> 03:56:11.080
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: Kaya yung 30% po na more or less 1 million hectares,

asr-003701
03:56:12.000 --> 03:56:15.360
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: ay yun po yung kasalukuyang pinupunuan.

asr-003702
03:56:15.380 --> 03:56:17.100
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: At yun po yung kasalukuyang pinupunuan natin na maging eligible land.

asr-003703
03:56:17.740 --> 03:56:21.520
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: Ang ka-akibat po kasing halaga na ito, pag kinuwento po natin,

asr-003704
03:56:21.660 --> 03:56:26.700
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: ay katulad ng sinasabi nga po natin kanina, more or less, mas 1 trillion pesos.

asr-003705
03:56:27.340 --> 03:56:28.720
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: Sa pag-eco-cover po, no?

asr-003706
03:56:28.840 --> 03:56:32.040
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: To cover the 1 million hectares.

asr-003707
03:56:32.160 --> 03:56:32.540
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: Okay po.

asr-003708
03:56:32.840 --> 03:56:35.880
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: Kaya kung titignan nga po natin, no,

asr-003709
03:56:38.880 --> 03:56:44.700
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: ay yung 600,000, mga 640 billion pesos,

asr-003710
03:56:45.380 --> 03:56:51.380
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: yung 400,000 biyan, 2030, another 400 plus billion pesos.

asr-003711
03:56:52.340 --> 03:56:55.160
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: Kung i-divide po natin sa sampuntaw nyo, more or less, mga,

asr-003712
03:56:55.980 --> 03:56:57.480
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: o lumalabas po doon, ikwan,

asr-003713
03:57:00.100 --> 03:57:07.980
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: lumalabas po mga more or less 160 billion pesos per year.

asr-003714
03:57:08.360 --> 03:57:09.380
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: Sampuntaw nyo yun.

asr-003715
03:57:09.860 --> 03:57:12.360
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: Yun ay purely for development.

asr-003716
03:57:13.020 --> 03:57:14.340
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: Apo, Mr. Speaker.

asr-003717
03:57:14.440 --> 03:57:15.340
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Thank you, Mr. Speaker.

asr-003718
03:57:15.380 --> 03:57:21.380
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: So, malinaw po yung targeting, no, ng National Irrigation Administration.

asr-003719
03:57:22.280 --> 03:57:29.780
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: And in fact, binanggit din po sa briefing na annually, nasa 1.5% ang na-accomplish ng NIA.

asr-003720
03:57:29.960 --> 03:57:30.500
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Tama po ba?

asr-003721
03:57:30.860 --> 03:57:42.140
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: Yung hung yearly na nade-develop based doon sa graph na lumabas ho na in 10 years mula noong 2015.

asr-003722
03:57:42.140 --> 03:57:45.140
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: Kung sa tignan ho natin, yun yung increase yung 1.5%.

asr-003723
03:57:45.380 --> 03:57:48.520
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: Yung 4% na napapatubigan ho natin.

asr-003724
03:57:48.860 --> 03:57:50.200
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Salamat, Mr. Speaker.

asr-003725
03:57:50.640 --> 03:57:55.600
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: So, ito pong tinatanong ko, Mr. Speaker, at sa ating kaibigang sponsor,

asr-003726
03:57:56.260 --> 03:58:02.560
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: pagpapatunay lang po yan na ang NIA merong master plan na sinusundan,

asr-003727
03:58:03.160 --> 03:58:05.300
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: may feasibility study na sinusundan,

asr-003728
03:58:05.760 --> 03:58:14.480
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: at malinaw sa ahensya kung saan ilalagay, ano yung ilalagay, ilan ang ilalagay.

asr-003729
03:58:14.480 --> 03:58:15.360
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Tama po ba ito?

asr-003730
03:58:15.740 --> 03:58:24.180
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: So, doon sa sinusundang master plan, very specific, determined by the National Irrigation Administration,

asr-003731
03:58:25.420 --> 03:58:27.760
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: ilan, ano, saan ilalagay?

asr-003732
03:58:27.960 --> 03:58:28.500
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Tama po, no?

asr-003733
03:58:29.200 --> 03:58:29.780
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Mr. Speaker?

asr-003734
03:58:30.220 --> 03:58:32.400
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: Mr. Speaker, Mr. Colleague, tama po.

asr-003735
03:58:32.400 --> 03:58:44.300
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: Yung hung tinatawag natin, yung binigay sa atin, yung una, yung National Irrigation Master Plan na dinisekho ng NIA

asr-003736
03:58:44.300 --> 03:58:44.400
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: through...

asr-003737
03:58:45.380 --> 03:58:52.880
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: So, Regional Irrigation Master Plan, ay doon ho natin makikita ang mga potential na area.

asr-003738
03:58:53.780 --> 03:59:03.060
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: Yung paggawa ng FS, pondohan natin, at para sa ganun, alam natin na yearly, doon ho, may pattern na tayo dapat sundan.

asr-003739
03:59:03.400 --> 03:59:04.940
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: Hindi na ho yung lipad-lipad pa.

asr-003740
03:59:05.720 --> 03:59:09.980
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: Yun ho yung sa malakihang usapin, lalo tigit sa CIS, saka NIS.

asr-003741
03:59:09.980 --> 03:59:13.980
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: Pero doon ho sa mga pump-pump naman, yun ho yung pa ilan-ilan na...

asr-003742
03:59:13.980 --> 03:59:20.620
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: Mas costly pa gumawa ho ng irrigation doon kung ilan lang naman ho pwedeng patubigan doon.

asr-003743
03:59:20.720 --> 03:59:23.260
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: Lalo tigit kung mataas naman ho ang slope ng lupa.

asr-003744
03:59:23.840 --> 03:59:32.240
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: Pero kung kaya naman ng mga 3% lang siya at malayong lugar, pwede na ho through pump na lang po siya.

asr-003745
03:59:32.440 --> 03:59:33.800
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: Mr. Speaker, this is Colleague.

asr-003746
03:59:33.800 --> 03:59:43.800
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: So, maraming salamat po, Mr. Speaker, dahil pinagtibay uli ng NIA through the sponsor na very specific, determined yung mga areas.

asr-003747
03:59:43.980 --> 03:59:44.640
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Ano?

asr-003748
03:59:45.280 --> 03:59:53.380
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Kanina po tinatanong ko sa una at pangalawang tanong ko, yung specifics, dapat may GU tagging, etc., etc.

asr-003749
03:59:53.660 --> 03:59:58.960
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Halimbawa po, sa isang proyekto ng DPWH, nag-random sampling lang po ang kinatawang ito, Mr. Speaker.

asr-003750
04:00:00.000 --> 04:00:09.580
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Ang isang sample po ay halimbawa ito, construction of Purok, this and that, sa isang particular na probinsya, lugar.

asr-003751
04:00:10.320 --> 04:00:17.640
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Start, 13.544866, 123.456452.

asr-003752
04:00:17.640 --> 04:00:23.780
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Ang end, 13.547692, 123.463323.

asr-003753
04:00:24.160 --> 04:00:27.020
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Ang ibig sabihin lang naman po nito, very specific, tama po ba?

asr-003754
04:00:27.020 --> 04:00:33.580
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Binanggit ng NIA through the sponsor na may sinusundan sila na master plan at feasibility study.

asr-003755
04:00:34.600 --> 04:00:44.700
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: In-admit din po ng NIA, Mr. Speaker, na very specific yung mga proyekto at mga programang pang-irigasyon na ini-implement ng NIA.

asr-003756
04:00:45.380 --> 04:00:53.400
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Ngayon, Mr. Speaker, ang tanong po ng kinatawang ito, sa page 844 ng General Appropriations Bill,

asr-003757
04:00:53.760 --> 04:00:55.780
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: meron pong isang line item.

asr-003758
04:00:55.780 --> 04:00:59.540
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Isan daang milyong piso ang inihinging budget ng NIA.

asr-003759
04:01:00.120 --> 04:01:07.060
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Ang nakasulat lang po dito, Mr. Speaker, rehabilitation and protection of watershed management.

asr-003760
04:01:08.080 --> 04:01:08.500
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: O saan to?

asr-003761
04:01:10.280 --> 04:01:11.660
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Saan to? Ano to?

asr-003762
04:01:12.920 --> 04:01:14.800
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Sabi nyo po kanina, sabi ng NIA.

asr-003763
04:01:15.820 --> 04:01:23.380
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Specific, nadedetermine, alam, nakabatay sa master plan at feasibility study.

asr-003764
04:01:24.660 --> 04:01:25.740
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Saan po itong?

asr-003765
04:01:25.780 --> 04:01:29.640
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Rehabilitation and protection of watershed management, 100 milyon pesos.

asr-003766
04:01:30.860 --> 04:01:31.380
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Mr. Speaker.

asr-003767
04:01:47.480 --> 04:01:54.240
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: Actually, Mr. Speaker, Mr. Colleague, yung sinasambit na ating samahan dito sa pulungan ay,

asr-003768
04:01:54.660 --> 04:01:55.760
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: ito yung mga critical.

asr-003769
04:01:55.780 --> 04:02:00.960
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: Ito yung mga critical watershed nationwide na may bilang na 164 units.

asr-003770
04:02:02.200 --> 04:02:03.980
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: Yung 100 milyong pesos.

asr-003771
04:02:04.540 --> 04:02:06.260
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: Nationwide po ito, Mr. Speaker.

asr-003772
04:02:06.660 --> 04:02:06.980
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Yes.

asr-003773
04:02:07.440 --> 04:02:08.440
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: So, saan po yan?

asr-003774
04:02:09.880 --> 04:02:10.600
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Mr. Speaker.

asr-003775
04:02:15.820 --> 04:02:23.160
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: Ito ho, depende na sa lugar na pwedeng maglagay ng watershed.

asr-003776
04:02:23.160 --> 04:02:25.160
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: Sa mga area na...

asr-003777
04:02:25.780 --> 04:02:27.780
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: Sa mga area na paglagyan ...

asr-003778
04:02:27.780 --> 04:02:29.780
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: ... na pplajihan.

asr-003779
04:02:29.780 --> 04:02:34.360
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: Although, nasabing nga po kanina, yung maging specific at maging particular,

asr-003780
04:02:34.360 --> 04:02:35.840
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: pero po kasi ito ay.

asr-003781
04:02:35.840 --> 04:02:38.560
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: Una, ay, dun nga po ...

asr-003782
04:02:38.560 --> 04:02:46.740
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: meron na silang bilang na 164 na critical watershed nationwide para sa gagawin nabanggit po natin.

asr-003783
04:02:51.000 --> 04:02:52.080
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Mr. Speaker,

asr-003784
04:02:53.200 --> 04:02:54.620
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Naintindihan ko po yung kalagayan

asr-003785
04:02:54.620 --> 04:02:55.780
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: ng ating kaibigan na sponsor.

asr-003786
04:02:56.780 --> 04:03:00.640
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Pinabanggit nga po ng NIA, meron silang datos. Tama po ba, Mr. Speaker?

asr-003787
04:03:01.440 --> 04:03:05.100
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Kumpleto kayo ng datos. O eto dapat yun ang nilagay ng NIA?

asr-003788
04:03:06.940 --> 04:03:08.640
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: O bakit hindi yung per detail?

asr-003789
04:03:11.680 --> 04:03:21.160
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: Well, Mr. Speaker, Distinguished Colleague, ito pong listing na ito ay kumamarapatin po ng ating kasamahan dito ay magbigay po kami ng listahan sa inyo, Mr. Speaker, Distinguished Colleague.

asr-003790
04:03:21.160 --> 04:03:24.860
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: I understand, Mr. Speaker, and sa kaibigan natin na sponsor.

asr-003791
04:03:25.760 --> 04:03:28.300
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Ang pinupunto ko, meron naman palang listahan yung NIA.

asr-003792
04:03:29.640 --> 04:03:30.740
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Eh, ba't di nyo nilagay?

asr-003793
04:03:32.260 --> 04:03:34.880
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: O di naguhulaan tayo saan ilalagay itong watershed?

asr-003794
04:03:35.280 --> 04:03:38.000
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Ano ba ito? Rehabilitation and Protection of Watershed Management.

asr-003795
04:03:38.420 --> 04:03:39.660
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Di natin alam saan ilalagay.

asr-003796
04:03:40.380 --> 04:03:43.520
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Sasabihin nyo, meron kayong listahan. O nasaan specific yan?

asr-003797
04:03:44.220 --> 04:03:47.840
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: To prove my point, Mr. Speaker, meron pang nakalagay dito.

asr-003798
04:03:48.360 --> 04:03:49.900
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Very general kasi, Mr. Speaker.

asr-003799
04:03:51.160 --> 04:03:57.580
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: So, TAGO RIS, Repair of Irrigation Canal, 100 million.

asr-003800
04:03:57.720 --> 04:03:59.780
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Saan ito? Ano ito?

asr-003810
04:04:48.000 --> 04:04:50.100
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: Mr. Speaker, distinguished colleague,

asr-003811
04:04:50.300 --> 04:05:01.160
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: Tama po yung nakita ni Apo Eli na dapat talaga ay naka-enumerated na siya.

asr-003812
04:05:02.720 --> 04:05:16.400
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: At ang system po ayon sa ating ahensya ay nailagay, bagamat nung lumabas yung NEP, hindi ho naging particular, Mr. Speaker, Distinguished Colleague.

asr-003813
04:05:16.400 --> 04:05:27.240
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: Pero nilagay po nila, pero pati yung barangay, munisipyo, bagamat nung lumabas nga po yung NEP, ay wala siya, Mr. Speaker, Distinguished Colleague.

asr-003814
04:05:27.540 --> 04:05:34.320
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Mr. Speaker, salamat po sa sagot ng sponsor, pero di ko po tinatanggap yung palusot ng NIA.

asr-003815
04:05:34.840 --> 04:05:46.360
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Kasi kung simple lang po ito na clerical error, kung magra-random sampling tayo, dapat by statistics or probability, maliit lang.

asr-003816
04:05:46.400 --> 04:05:48.520
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Yung mga bilang ng mga errors.

asr-003817
04:05:48.860 --> 04:05:58.080
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Pero Mr. Speaker, nagra-random sampling kami kanina pa, nakikita namin napakarami na mga general and walang mga detalye, undetailed.

asr-003818
04:05:59.240 --> 04:05:59.800
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Halimbawa,

asr-003819
04:06:07.840 --> 04:06:09.320
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: isang line item,

asr-003820
04:06:10.840 --> 04:06:12.900
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: construction of concrete pavement,

asr-003821
04:06:14.160 --> 04:06:15.560
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: page 842.

asr-003822
04:06:16.400 --> 04:06:17.620
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Paliko, RIS.

asr-003823
04:06:18.320 --> 04:06:20.060
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Construction of service road,

asr-003824
04:06:21.200 --> 04:06:22.640
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Santa Maria, RIS.

asr-003825
04:06:22.720 --> 04:06:25.100
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Saan tong Santa Maria? Ang daming Santa Maria sa Pilipinas.

asr-003826
04:06:32.840 --> 04:06:35.620
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: So, binabanggit kanina, Mr. Speaker,

asr-003827
04:06:37.460 --> 04:06:38.280
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: ng NIA,

asr-003828
04:06:39.980 --> 04:06:43.880
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: identified, may sinusundan ng master plan, feasibility study,

asr-003829
04:06:46.400 --> 04:06:49.700
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: meron pa po, Mr. Speaker, halimbawa,

asr-003830
04:06:50.920 --> 04:06:52.700
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: concreting of service roads.

asr-003831
04:06:54.300 --> 04:06:54.620
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Ano to?

asr-003832
04:06:58.740 --> 04:07:01.440
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: At isa pa, improvement of intake.

asr-003833
04:07:03.340 --> 04:07:05.000
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Alip, RIS.

asr-003834
04:07:08.420 --> 04:07:11.500
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Hindi po maunawaan, Mr. Speaker, ng kinatawang ito,

asr-003835
04:07:11.660 --> 04:07:12.840
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: nang binabanggit ng NIA,

asr-003836
04:07:13.240 --> 04:07:16.100
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: they are following a master plan and feasibility study,

asr-003837
04:07:16.400 --> 04:07:17.060
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: and yet,

asr-003838
04:07:18.220 --> 04:07:20.080
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: when we are asking directly

