Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Kagaya nung 2025, ang target po natin na service areas ay...

asr-004051
04:30:00.000 --> 04:30:07.800
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: 8,692 hektars. Pero yung actual lang po natin na na-accomplish, 3,162.

asr-004052
04:30:08.520 --> 04:30:19.940
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Ang nakita ko lang na problema, sa 2027, bumaba yung budget natin, yung sabi mo, mga 19%,

asr-004053
04:30:19.940 --> 04:30:32.800
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: pero nilakihan pa natin yung target area, ginawa natin from 8,620 to 11,153.

asr-004054
04:30:33.220 --> 04:30:44.740
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Huwag nyo na pong sagutin, Distinguished Sponsor, inano ko lang yung atensyon ni Admin Guillen,

asr-004055
04:30:44.740 --> 04:30:48.600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: na sana, I hope, and pray,

asr-004056
04:30:48.600 --> 04:30:55.620
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: na kahit man lang sa 11,000, maabot natin yung 10,000.

asr-004057
04:30:56.200 --> 04:31:01.580
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Kasi sa experience natin, halos kalahati lang sa target ang na-accomplish.

asr-004058
