Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: kung mayroon pong magre-reklamo na hindi sila napasama.

asr-004493
05:12:34.800 --> 05:12:35.740
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Ano po yung ginagawa?

asr-004494
