Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: To be specific, ano po yung ginagawa natin ngayon?

asr-004495
05:12:39.280 --> 05:12:42.100
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: To correct yung problema dati.

asr-004496
05:12:44.520 --> 05:12:47.820
