asr-005326
05:52:19.580 --> 05:52:36.260
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: all around the country. They lack budget, their employees are J.O., and they even lack cars.

asr-005327
05:52:36.660 --> 05:52:39.600
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: So what actions are taken to combat smuggling and hoarding?

asr-005328
05:52:40.180 --> 05:52:46.540
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: The DA has sent inspection teams to the ports of Manila, Manila International Container Port,

asr-005329
05:52:47.120 --> 05:52:49.560
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Naia, Batangas, Subic, Cebu, Davao.

asr-005330
05:52:49.580 --> 05:52:53.900
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Sambuanga, and Cagayan de Oro to monitor and support border inspections.

asr-005331
05:52:54.480 --> 05:52:57.220
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: So despite the limited budget, ginagawa po nila yun.

asr-005332
05:52:57.640 --> 05:53:09.080
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Meron din po silang DAIE teams to monitor and witness the conduct of the second border inspection and condemnation activities.

asr-005333
05:53:09.660 --> 05:53:14.060
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Meron din po silang Special Operations Group to serve as the official representative of the office

asr-005334
05:53:14.060 --> 05:53:16.240
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: during high-risk enforcement operations.

asr-005335
05:53:16.240 --> 05:53:19.500
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: And they have an investigation branch to monitor.

asr-005336
05:53:19.500 --> 05:53:21.580
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: To monitor the implementation of banner programs.

asr-005337
05:53:22.580 --> 05:53:28.800
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: And to monitor also illegal smuggling and economic sabotage activities.

asr-005338
05:53:28.840 --> 05:53:36.300
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: So despite their limited budget due to limited fiscal space,

asr-005339
05:53:36.680 --> 05:53:44.960
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: they are doing a variety of activities to be able to support our anti-smuggling and anti-economic sabotage policies.

asr-005340
05:53:44.960 --> 05:53:48.520
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Thank you, Mr. Speaker, Madam Sponsor.

asr-005341
05:53:49.500 --> 05:53:49.900
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Last question.

asr-005342
05:53:50.460 --> 05:53:53.600
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: El Nino, crop insurance after calamities.

asr-005343
05:53:54.000 --> 05:53:57.680
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Mrs. Speaker, good sponsor, DAIE has already stated before

asr-005344
05:53:57.680 --> 05:54:05.900
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: that strong El Nino could have reduced polyproduction by approximately 750,000 metric tons.

asr-005345
05:54:06.200 --> 05:54:06.700
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Is this correct?

asr-005346
05:54:10.700 --> 05:54:15.000
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Nagbigay na po ng assistance po ang DAIE.

asr-005347
05:54:16.880 --> 05:54:18.840
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: What I'm trying to say is...

asr-005348
05:54:18.840 --> 05:54:20.940
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: And we're also working on...

asr-005349
05:54:20.940 --> 05:54:25.620
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: I have discussed cloud seeding po with the Bureau of Soils and Water Management.

asr-005350
05:54:25.860 --> 05:54:28.280
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Honorable Speaker, a distinguished colleague.

asr-005351
05:54:29.020 --> 05:54:32.580
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: And they're also working on solar irrigation pumps.

asr-005352
05:54:34.240 --> 05:54:35.280
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Mr. Speaker...

asr-005353
05:54:35.280 --> 05:54:36.900
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: At lahat po yan ay ginagawa po nila.

asr-005354
05:54:36.900 --> 05:54:41.940
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: My question is, ito ba 750,000 because of El Nino effect?

asr-005355
05:54:42.460 --> 05:54:46.600
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Ito ba ay tatamaan tayo around 750,000 metric tons?

asr-005356
05:54:47.160 --> 05:54:48.600
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Pag hindi kayo nag-cloud seeding...

asr-005357
05:54:48.840 --> 05:54:49.600
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Ito yun.

asr-005358
05:54:49.800 --> 05:54:50.280
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Tama to.

asr-005359
05:54:50.960 --> 05:54:53.780
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Tama po yan, Mr. Speaker, distinguished colleague.

asr-005360
05:54:54.980 --> 05:54:59.780
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: So, I guess the next question, because of how to mitigate and plano nang nyo,

asr-005361
05:55:00.060 --> 05:55:02.460
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: sinagot mo na because of the cloud seeding.

asr-005362
05:55:02.580 --> 05:55:03.020
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: What else?

asr-005363
05:55:04.620 --> 05:55:07.300
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Ano yung cloud seeding to prevent...

asr-005364
05:55:07.300 --> 05:55:10.840
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Our plans for El Nino include cloud seeding,

asr-005365
05:55:12.840 --> 05:55:15.700
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: small shallow tube wells,

asr-005366
05:55:16.520 --> 05:55:18.820
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: smaller water retention basins,

asr-005367
05:55:18.840 --> 05:55:19.460
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: upland.

asr-005368
05:55:21.980 --> 05:55:23.000
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Thank you.

asr-005369
05:55:23.300 --> 05:55:31.200
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: And also, finding proper climate change resilient varieties that they could plant,

asr-005370
05:55:31.300 --> 05:55:33.460
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: which could survive with less water.

asr-005371
05:55:34.260 --> 05:55:35.880
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Thank you, Mr. Speaker.

asr-005372
05:55:36.780 --> 05:55:38.900
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: And as a sponsor of this representation,

asr-005373
05:55:39.320 --> 05:55:43.100
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: thanks to the distinguished sponsor for the responses and clarification.

asr-005374
05:55:43.780 --> 05:55:46.140
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: With that, I have no more further questions.

asr-005375
05:55:46.140 --> 05:55:47.760
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Mr. Speaker, for the record,

asr-005376
05:55:48.840 --> 05:55:51.560
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: I support the budget of Department of Agriculture

asr-005377
05:55:51.560 --> 05:55:55.640
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: kasi napaka-importante po sa ating mga mamayang Pilipino.

asr-005378
05:55:55.740 --> 05:55:56.440
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Maraming salamat po.

asr-005379
05:55:57.040 --> 05:55:59.100
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Maraming salamat din po, Mr. Speaker.

asr-005380
05:56:00.880 --> 05:56:01.600
Deputy Speaker Jefferson F. Khonghun: Majority Leader.

asr-005381
05:56:05.480 --> 05:56:08.560
Rep. Eduardo R. Rama Jr.: Mr. Speaker, next to interpolate the sponsor,

asr-005382
05:56:08.560 --> 05:56:14.340
Rep. Eduardo R. Rama Jr.: I move to recognize Representative Sarah Jane Elago

asr-005383
05:56:14.340 --> 05:56:16.820
Rep. Eduardo R. Rama Jr.: of Gabriela Women's Party List.

asr-005384
05:56:17.360 --> 05:56:18.820
Deputy Speaker Jefferson F. Khonghun: The Honorable Sarah Jane Ilago,

asr-005385
05:56:18.840 --> 05:56:19.640
Deputy Speaker Jefferson F. Khonghun: is now recognized.

asr-005386
05:56:21.460 --> 05:56:23.660
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Mr. Speaker, maraming salamat.

asr-005387
05:56:24.260 --> 05:56:27.140
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ang Department of Agriculture Secretary ay miyembro

asr-005388
05:56:27.140 --> 05:56:29.840
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: ng Unified Package for Livelihoods, Industry,

asr-005389
05:56:30.880 --> 05:56:34.060
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Food and Transport or Uplift Committee

asr-005390
05:56:34.060 --> 05:56:37.240
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: sa bisa ng Executive Order No. 110.

asr-005391
05:56:37.940 --> 05:56:40.640
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Maari po bang mag-ulat ng ating distinguished sponsor

asr-005392
05:56:40.640 --> 05:56:43.840
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: kung ano-ano na yung mga programa

asr-005393
05:56:44.380 --> 05:56:48.260
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: na ipatupad ng Department of Agriculture

asr-005394
05:56:48.260 --> 05:56:51.680
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: kaugnay ng mandato nito sa Uplift?

asr-005395
05:56:52.540 --> 05:56:57.100
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: At magkano na ang nagastos natin ngayong 2026?

asr-005396
05:56:57.440 --> 05:57:00.660
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: At meron ho ba tayong plano para sa 2027

asr-005397
05:57:00.660 --> 05:57:04.880
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: na mapagpatuloy yung iba't-ibang assistance program

asr-005398
05:57:04.880 --> 05:57:09.060
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: na may kinalaman sa pagtugon sa impact ng pagtaas

asr-005399
05:57:09.060 --> 05:57:13.660
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: ng presyo ng langis sa mga magsasaka at manginisda?

asr-005400
05:57:16.380 --> 05:57:18.240
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Nagbigay, thank you so much for this.

asr-005401
05:57:18.260 --> 05:57:21.220
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: This is a very, very urgent concern, Mr. Speaker,

asr-005402
05:57:21.400 --> 05:57:23.180
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: and our distinguished colleague.

asr-005403
05:57:23.500 --> 05:57:26.300
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Nagbigay po ang Department of Agriculture ng Fuel Assistance

asr-005404
05:57:26.300 --> 05:57:30.120
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: to farmers and fisher folks and fertilizer assistance.

asr-005405
05:57:38.940 --> 05:57:43.040
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Mr. Speaker, saan po nang galing na particular line item

asr-005406
05:57:43.040 --> 05:57:46.140
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: ang pinagkunan ng Department of Agriculture

asr-005407
05:57:46.140 --> 05:57:48.240
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: para sa fuel subsidies na ito?

asr-005408
05:57:48.260 --> 05:57:52.180
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Nang galing po ba sa Presidential Assistance

asr-005409
05:57:52.180 --> 05:57:53.880
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: for Farmers and Fisher Folk?

asr-005410
05:57:54.220 --> 05:57:56.760
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Meron pa ba tayong ibang mga line item

asr-005411
05:57:56.760 --> 05:58:00.860
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: na pinagkunan ng napakahalaga na fuel subsidies na ito?

asr-005412
05:58:07.000 --> 05:58:08.900
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Much needed po ito, no?

asr-005413
05:58:10.700 --> 05:58:11.420
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Okay.

asr-005414
05:58:13.440 --> 05:58:16.040
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: The assistance po to our farmers

asr-005415
05:58:16.040 --> 05:58:18.240
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: was taken from the savings of the DBM,

asr-005416
05:58:18.260 --> 05:58:20.620
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: 602 to 603.

asr-005417
05:58:22.980 --> 05:58:25.720
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Mr. Speaker, yun po ang pinagkakunan po

asr-005418
05:58:25.720 --> 05:58:27.500
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: ng ating fuel assistance.

asr-005419
05:58:29.160 --> 05:58:30.980
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Maraming salamat, ginoong Speaker.

asr-005420
05:58:31.280 --> 05:58:35.120
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: At ang isa po sa mabigat na balita sa ating mga kababayan

asr-005421
05:58:35.120 --> 05:58:37.380
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: ngayong linggo ay muli na namang tumaas

asr-005422
05:58:37.380 --> 05:58:39.260
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: ang presyo ng langis.

asr-005423
05:58:39.380 --> 05:58:42.000
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: At ang kapulungan na ito sa 20th Congress

asr-005424
05:58:42.000 --> 05:58:45.400
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: ay madali po natin naipasa

asr-005425
05:58:45.400 --> 05:58:47.260
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: yung Republic Act No.

asr-005426
05:58:47.260 --> 05:58:48.240
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: 12316,

asr-005427
05:58:48.740 --> 05:58:53.240
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Na nagbibigay ng emergency powers sa presidente

asr-005428
05:58:53.240 --> 05:58:56.020
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: para po temporarily ma-suspend muna

asr-005429
05:58:56.020 --> 05:58:59.840
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: o mabawasan ang excise taxes sa petroleum products.

asr-005430
05:59:00.240 --> 05:59:02.420
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Mahalaga ito, Mr. Speaker,

asr-005431
05:59:02.660 --> 05:59:06.400
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: dahil alam po natin kung gaano ginagamit

asr-005432
05:59:06.400 --> 05:59:08.120
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: ng ating mga magsasaka

asr-005433
05:59:08.120 --> 05:59:12.340
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: sa kanilang mga makinarya, traktora, ang langis.

asr-005434
05:59:12.680 --> 05:59:14.400
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ganon din po sa mga manging isda.

asr-005435
05:59:14.640 --> 05:59:17.280
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Yung krudo na ginagamit nila sa pamamalakaya,

asr-005436
05:59:17.280 --> 05:59:18.240
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: sa paglalaot,

asr-005437
05:59:18.260 --> 05:59:22.060
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: ay nakakaapekto po ang mataas na presyo ng langis.

asr-005438
05:59:22.360 --> 05:59:30.080
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Sa katunayan, yung isa nga pong mahalagang concern na napaabot din natin sa ating lead council dito sa House of Representatives,

asr-005439
05:59:30.080 --> 05:59:36.080
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: hindi po talaga sapat yung mga fuel subsidy dahil nasa 2,000 plus pesos lang po ito

asr-005440
05:59:36.820 --> 05:59:43.660
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: at malayo doon sa kinakailangan na nasa 15,000 to 30,000 na kailangan ng isang bangka

asr-005441
05:59:43.660 --> 05:59:48.240
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: para matiyak na siya ay makapamalaot at magaroon ng huli.

asr-005442
05:59:48.680 --> 05:59:49.860
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Para sa isang araw.

asr-005443
05:59:50.400 --> 05:59:53.780
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Kaya ang nangyayari, yung dapat sana na fuel subsidy,

asr-005444
05:59:53.780 --> 05:59:58.980
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: imbes na gamitin nila pambili ng langis, ay ginagamit na lang pong pambili ng pagkain.

asr-005445
06:00:00.000 --> 06:00:16.560
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ang nangyayari po dyan, natatalo po yung ating layunin na matulak ang mga magsasaka at mangingisda. Sa magsasaka, magpatuloy sa pagtatanim at sa mga mangingisda naman, makapagpatuloy po sa paglaot.

asr-005446
06:00:16.560 --> 06:00:34.620
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ngayon, dahil po naglabas na ng certification ang Department of Energy at tungkol po dun sa pag-abot natin dun sa trigger na nasa 80 US dollars per barrel na presyo po ng Dubai crude oil,

asr-005447
06:00:34.620 --> 06:00:46.120
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: meron na po ba tayong maaasahang aksyon mula dito sa uplift at meron po bang rekomendasyon ang Department of Agriculture tungkol sa pagsususpindi at pagbabawasan?

asr-005448
06:00:46.560 --> 06:00:56.180
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Thank you so much, Mr. Speaker. Ito po, I would like to share the position of the Department of Agriculture.

asr-005449
06:00:56.180 --> 06:01:11.980
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: The DA supports in principle the temporary de-implementation or suspension of VAT and excise tax on fuel during periods of exceptionally high fuel prices as a measure to reduce cost pressures across the agricultural and fisheries value chain.

asr-005450
06:01:12.500 --> 06:01:15.040
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Moreover po, ano pa po ang ginagawa natin?

asr-005451
06:01:15.040 --> 06:01:22.280
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: We are including the fuel assistance po sa ating QRF and we are seeking po more funds for fuel assistance.

asr-005452
06:01:23.380 --> 06:01:29.100
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Maraming salamat, Ginong Speaker. Nagagalak po tayong marinig ng posisyon ng Department of Agriculture,

asr-005453
06:01:29.540 --> 06:01:37.900
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: hindi lang bawasan o hindi lang temporarily suspindihin ang excise taxes sa petroleum products, kundi pati na rin ang value-added tax.

asr-005454
06:01:38.320 --> 06:01:44.860
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Napakabigat po ng 12% na VAT sa petroleum products na lalong nagpapasirit ng presyo.

asr-005455
06:01:45.040 --> 06:01:57.220
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Nang langis, maaari po ba nating malaman kung ano pa ang hinihintay na desisyon pagdating sa pagsususpindi o pagbabawas o pagsama ng VAT?

asr-005456
06:01:57.480 --> 06:02:02.180
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Dahil ang posisyon ng DA malinaw, pero sino pa po ba ang ating hinihintay sa ngayon?

asr-005457
06:02:02.640 --> 06:02:07.800
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Dahil ang DOE may certification na yung uplift ba, nakapagpulong na po ba?

asr-005458
06:02:09.760 --> 06:02:14.800
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Kailan po natin maaasahan na magkaroon ng anunsyo tungkol sa paggamit?

asr-005459
06:02:15.040 --> 06:02:17.340
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: At nang emergency powers na ito?

asr-005460
06:02:18.720 --> 06:02:24.500
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Mr. Speaker, last week po, there was a high-level cabinet meeting regarding increasing fuel prices.

asr-005461
06:02:25.360 --> 06:02:37.040
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: So, rest assured na pinagplaplanuhan na po ang pagtaas, sadly, ang pagtaas ng fuel prices.

asr-005462
06:02:38.780 --> 06:02:43.640
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Mr. Speaker, ang panawagan po ng representasyon na ito dapat sa lalong madaling panahon.

asr-005463
06:02:43.640 --> 06:02:59.140
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Dahil yan naman po ang layunin ng pag-grant ng emergency powers na mabilis na magagawa ng aksyon yung dapat pong matugunan na issue ng ating mga kababayan sa pagsirit ng presyo ng lanis.

asr-005464
06:02:59.880 --> 06:03:04.640
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Malinaw po na meron ng trigger, naabot na yan, may certification na rin mula sa DOE.

asr-005465
06:03:04.640 --> 06:03:10.480
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ang kinakailangan po natin, mabilis na aksyon ng pamahalaan tungkol dito.

asr-005466
06:03:10.920 --> 06:03:12.640
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Dahil sa bawat araw na hindi tayo...

asr-005467
06:03:13.640 --> 06:03:25.440
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Kumikilos sa bawat araw na naghihintay po tayo ng pag-anunsyo, ay isang araw din na lalong pinapasa ng mga kababayan natin yung mas mataas na presyo ng lanis.

asr-005468
06:03:25.580 --> 06:03:27.920
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Hindi lang po yan nakaka-apekto sa agrikultura.

asr-005469
06:03:28.700 --> 06:03:40.420
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Alam po natin kung gano'n rin katindi ang impact sa transport sector, sa logistics, na lubos din po ang effect sa agriculture sector, sa delivery, sa transport ng kanilang mga local produce.

asr-005470
06:03:40.420 --> 06:03:41.940
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Kaya muli, dapat po.

asr-005471
06:03:42.360 --> 06:03:43.420
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Hindi lang suspindihan.

asr-005472
06:03:43.640 --> 06:03:50.040
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Kung pwede nga, pag-aralan na rin po ng kapulungan na ito na ibasura yung excise taxes sa petroleum products.

asr-005473
06:03:50.300 --> 06:04:02.100
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Gayun din, panahon na na ma-review, hindi lang po yung pag-suspindi, pagbabawas, kundi yung pagtatanggal ng 12% na value-added tax sa mga mahalaga lang naman po na pangangailangan.

asr-005474
06:04:02.400 --> 06:04:04.960
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Kumbaga yung mga basic needs ng ating mga kababayan.

asr-005475
06:04:05.520 --> 06:04:09.300
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Pagkain, kuryente, iba pang utilities at langis.

asr-005476
06:04:09.760 --> 06:04:13.480
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Sunod naman po, anais ko pong magtanong tungkol sa...

asr-005477
06:04:13.640 --> 06:04:25.340
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: 2024 Commission on Audit, Annual Audit Report Observation tungkol po sa pagpapatupad ng RSF at ng Rice Farmers Financial Assistance.

asr-005478
06:04:26.240 --> 06:04:38.060
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Sinabi po sa kanilang 2024 AAR na nakapagtala ng total na 58,784 farmer beneficiaries mula po sa mga piling rehyon.

asr-005479
06:04:38.060 --> 06:04:43.060
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: At sinabi po dito na hindi po lahat ng nakatanggap ay eligible.

asr-005480
06:04:43.640 --> 06:04:44.680
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Na makatanggap.

asr-005481
06:04:45.220 --> 06:04:50.520
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Maari po ba tayong bigyan ng update ng Department of Agriculture tungkol dito?

asr-005482
06:04:50.820 --> 06:05:05.740
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Paano po ba natin natitiyak na lahat ng ating mga financial assistance na binibigay sa Rice Farmers ay napupunta dun sa mga nararapat, nangangailangan at tunay na qualified, batay po sa ating mga pamantayan?

asr-005483
06:05:10.120 --> 06:05:12.420
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Thank you so much, Mr. Speaker.

asr-005484
06:05:13.640 --> 06:05:17.420
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: The DA goes through each and every complaint po.

asr-005485
06:05:17.880 --> 06:05:27.400
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: And we have a list po of resolved cases by the DA which we are happy to share po with our distinguished colleagues, Mr. Speaker.

asr-005486
06:05:27.820 --> 06:05:30.560
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: So, Mr. Speaker, nandito po yung mga na-resolved issues po.

asr-005487
06:05:31.000 --> 06:05:31.720
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Andami po nito.

asr-005488
06:05:32.160 --> 06:05:35.120
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: And we are happy to share them with our colleague.

asr-005489
06:05:35.120 --> 06:05:43.120
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: And again, ano po, I personally witnessed the DA distribution of assistance.

asr-005490
06:05:43.640 --> 06:05:49.400
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Napaka-thorough po po nila, including pictures of every single farmer.

asr-005491
06:05:50.240 --> 06:05:55.800
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: And when they give assistance, malakihan po yan eh.

asr-005492
06:05:56.140 --> 06:05:57.860
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: So, it's a small town.

asr-005493
06:05:58.440 --> 06:05:59.500
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: It's a small barangay.

asr-005494
06:05:59.900 --> 06:06:01.060
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: People know each other eh.

asr-005495
06:06:01.480 --> 06:06:10.700
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: And we actually say on the mic, and I have to credit the DA po, sinasabi po nila, kung meron pong may reklamo, magreklamo na po on the spot.

asr-005496
06:06:10.700 --> 06:06:13.620
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: If they do feel that an unqualified person.

asr-005497
06:06:13.640 --> 06:06:15.640
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: was given assistance.

asr-005498
06:06:16.560 --> 06:06:22.640
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Actually, tying it to our previous distinguished colleagues, Mr. Speaker, question about the RSBSA.

asr-005499
06:06:23.600 --> 06:06:25.020
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Malaking bagay po talaga.

asr-005500
06:06:25.700 --> 06:06:36.640
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Actually, I would be more concerned about persons not, qualified persons not receiving assistance versus like a syndicate of unqualified persons rushing to receive assistance.

asr-005501
06:06:37.700 --> 06:06:43.040
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: As we have discussed earlier, there is actually an undercount of the RSBSA.

asr-005502
06:06:43.040 --> 06:06:54.500
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: So, ang dami pong, mas marami pong nagre-reklamo po sa amin na hindi po sila nasama doon sa tulong ng DA kesa sa doon sa nagre-reklamo na hindi po qualified yung katabi po nilang kasama.

asr-005503
06:06:54.980 --> 06:07:04.320
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: So, again, we can only correct all of these and resolve all of these and rest assured that the DA is very open to complaints right there and then on the spot po.

asr-005504
06:07:04.680 --> 06:07:07.520
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Pwede pong magreklamo at tatanggapin po namin.

asr-005505
06:07:07.700 --> 06:07:12.720
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Aside from that po, we also need to work po with the LGUs kasi sila po talaga.

asr-005506
06:07:13.040 --> 06:07:22.440
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: We don't have extension workers and the mouse to make sure po na yung talagang tama ho yung kuhanan po, nabigyan po ng assistance.

asr-005507
06:07:22.920 --> 06:07:35.080
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: And rest assured po, if we find anybody or any group that is organizing themselves and falsely misrepresenting themselves to receive assistance from the government, e kakasuhan po yun.

asr-005508
06:07:36.880 --> 06:07:39.480
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Maraming salamat, Mr. Speaker, Distinguished Sponsor.

asr-005509
06:07:39.560 --> 06:07:42.880
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Dalawang bagay na napakahalaga mula po sa sagot ng ating Distinguished Sponsor.

asr-005510
06:07:43.040 --> 06:08:00.040
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Yung una, dapat naman talaga matiyak natin na kung ano yung observation ng COA magagawa natin ng paraan para mahigpit at kung ano yung dapat na financial assistance sa mga rice farmers na sobrang sobra na apektado ng rice importation ay ating matutulungan.

asr-005511
06:08:01.360 --> 06:08:07.120
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Sa pangalawang mahalagang bagay na nabanggitin nyo, yung kahirapan din ng ating mga farmers sa pagpaparegister.

asr-005512
06:08:07.120 --> 06:08:12.920
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Sa totoo lang po, hindi po yan ang unang pagkakataon na narinig ng representasyon na ito.

asr-005513
06:08:13.040 --> 06:08:27.980
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Hindi lang po sa mga magsasaka, pero sa bahagi din po ng ating mga banging isda na hindi po lahat, lalong-lalo na yung ating mga maliliit na mga fisher folk ay nakakapagparegister at napapaabutan po ng kinakailangan na tulong.

asr-005514
06:08:28.480 --> 06:08:43.020
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Abagamat, naiintindihan ko po, kasi nakita rin natin dito, Mr. Speaker, na bagamat gusto pong matulungan lahat ng mga nakaregister, napakaliit na prosyento lang po yung natutulungan kasi napakalimitado lang po ng pondo.

asr-005515
06:08:43.040 --> 06:08:47.040
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Para sa ganitong tipo ng mga subsidies at mga financial assistance.

asr-005516
06:08:48.180 --> 06:09:01.020
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Kaya nga po, at nakita ko rin po ang puno ng ating committed agriculture na tayo po ay hindi lang umaasa, pero excited po tayo na dapat naman,

asr-005517
06:09:01.020 --> 06:09:09.540
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: kung paano ko na napag-usapan yung pinapanawagan na production subsidy ng mga farmers and fisher folk dito sa ating bansa.

asr-005518
06:09:10.080 --> 06:09:12.020
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Dahil, Mr. Speaker, sa kanila din po nagmumula.

asr-005519
06:09:12.020 --> 06:09:22.080
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Nagmumula yung mga pinakamahihirap nating mga kababayan na nanatiling nasa 25 to 36 percent pa rin po ang poverty incidence sa sektor ng agriculture,

asr-005520
06:09:22.680 --> 06:09:29.400
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: lalong-lalo na po farmer, fisher folk at workers in the agricultural sector.

asr-005521
06:09:29.400 --> 06:09:40.680
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ngayon po, meron ba kayong proposal dun po sa inyong original na naisumite sa DBM na may kinalaman sa fuel subsidies,

asr-005522
06:09:41.020 --> 06:09:42.000
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: financial assistance?

asr-005523
06:09:42.020 --> 06:09:48.840
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: and production subsidies na hindi naisama sa General Appropriations Bill.

asr-005524
06:09:49.580 --> 06:09:59.260
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Yung mga priority natin na sa tingin po natin dapat pondohan, pero sa ngayon ay hindi nalaana ng pondo sa General Appropriations Bill.

asr-005525
06:10:00.120 --> 06:10:11.240
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Mr. Speaker, tinatanong ko ito dahil ang mga magsasaka at may ngisda talaga pong gustong banguna rin na itulak

asr-005526
06:10:12.020 --> 06:10:20.660
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: na ito na dapat huwag tayong pumayag na hindi malalagyan ng production subsidies sa ngayon ang ating farmers and fisher folk.

asr-005527
06:10:21.460 --> 06:10:27.800
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Thank you, Mr. Speaker. Tama po yun. Sadly, I have to agree po with our distinguished colleagues.

asr-005528
06:10:28.460 --> 06:10:41.580
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: The DA budget has been reduced by 8 percent and we are requesting, number one po, meron po silang 11-point strategic plan para po,

asr-005529
06:10:41.580 --> 06:10:50.220
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: po, ma-maintain po ang ating gains in production, which we are afraid po dahil tama po yung sinabi ng ating distinguished colleague.

asr-005530
06:10:52.820 --> 06:11:04.220
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Sadly, I have to agree na marami pong nagkulang. So, we are requesting po more assistance for the expanded fertilizer assistance, almost 9B.

asr-005531
06:11:04.220 --> 06:11:09.780
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Yung ating farm-to-market bridges development program. Ito po para gumanda po yung logistics.

asr-005532
06:11:09.780 --> 06:11:19.940
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Our hybrid solar power ice plants at marami pa pong iba, which I would be happy to share with our distinguished colleagues dito, Mr. Speaker.

asr-005533
06:11:20.440 --> 06:11:23.200
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: So, yes, unfortunately, maraming nabawasan.

asr-005534
06:11:24.060 --> 06:11:29.580
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Mr. Speaker, mahingi din na lang po tayo ng detalyadong report tungkol naman sa access sa fertilizer.

asr-005535
06:11:29.800 --> 06:11:37.780
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Dahil po bukod sa langis, yan din po ang isa sa pinakasumirit ang presyo dahil muli nakaasa na naman po tayo sa importation.

asr-005536
06:11:37.780 --> 06:11:52.700
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Samantalang, marami din pong lumapit sa representasyon na ito na marami pong mga locally developed fertilizer na kulang-nakulang po ang suporta pagdating sa pagsiscale ng production para makatulong sa ating local agriculture.

asr-005537
06:11:52.700 --> 06:12:03.460
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: That's for another deliberation and discussion. Pero napakahalaga po ng usapin ng access ng abono dito sa ating bansa.

asr-005538
06:12:03.840 --> 06:12:07.720
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ngayon, nais ko naman pong magtanong. Sundan ko lang po yung mga katanungan ng mga nauna.

asr-005539
06:12:07.780 --> 06:12:25.680
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Sa minority tungkol sa rice importation. Sinabi po ni DA Secretary Chula Aurel nitong September 2026 lang po na 5 million metric tons ang tinatayang rice imports ngayong taong 2026.

asr-005540
06:12:25.680 --> 06:12:37.000
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Kung titignan sa kasaysayan ng Pilipinas, ang ating rice importation mula taong 2000, ito na ang pinakamataas na import ng ating bansa.

asr-005541
06:12:37.780 --> 06:12:44.980
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ano po ba ang magiging epekto nito sa ating rice self-sufficiency at sa kita ng mga local farmers?

asr-005542
06:12:45.940 --> 06:12:58.340
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Hindi po ba ito indikasyon na sa halip na mababawasan ang ating dependence sa imported rice, lalo pa nating matataasan yung ating dependence sa imported rice.

asr-005543
06:12:58.340 --> 06:13:07.340
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Sa katunayan po, mula sa 9% na rice import dependence mula taong 1990, tumaas na ito ng 23%.

asr-005544
06:13:07.780 --> 06:13:16.380
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Sa taong 2022. So ganun po kabilis, Mr. Speaker, yung pagsirit na nga rice import dependence natin.

asr-005545
06:13:16.800 --> 06:13:26.240
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: From 9% in the year 1990 to 23% in the year 2022. So more than double.

asr-005546
06:13:27.460 --> 06:13:37.240
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Kaya po nababahala tayo sa pahayag na ito na buka pong tayo na naman ang magiging isa sa pinakamataas.

asr-005547
06:13:37.780 --> 06:13:42.700
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Nangunguna na rice importer dito sa ating bansa sa buong mundo.

asr-005548
06:13:43.000 --> 06:13:56.200
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Samantalang sa ating bansa, marami po tayong very much willing pa rin to be involved, get involved, and actively produce through our local agriculture.

asr-005549
06:13:56.200 --> 06:14:06.920
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Pero nabanggit nyo rin po kanina sa isa nating interpellator na hanggat hindi mo sasagutin yung issue ng profits, hanggat hindi mo matitiyak yung maayos na farm gate price,

asr-005550
06:14:07.780 --> 06:14:10.380
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: mamamatay po talaga yung ating local production.

asr-005551
06:14:10.560 --> 06:14:21.460
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: So ang katanungan ko po ay wala po bang ibang plano bukod sa mag-asa na naman po sa rice importation para sa susunod na taon?

asr-005552
06:14:23.580 --> 06:14:35.680
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Mr. Speaker, again, we had to import because of the El Nino situation for this year.

asr-005553
06:14:35.680 --> 06:14:36.960
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: But definitely next year.

asr-005554
06:14:37.780 --> 06:14:45.960
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Last year, there was a large drop in imports because we suspended importation to support farm gate prices.

asr-005555
06:14:46.880 --> 06:14:59.980
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: So we are open to various interventions to support our local farmers and to give them prices that are competitive and that will...

asr-005556
06:15:00.000 --> 06:15:02.060
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: support the

asr-005557
06:15:02.060 --> 06:15:03.580
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: cost of the inputs.

asr-005558
06:15:04.540 --> 06:15:06.460
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: So, next year, we foresee

asr-005559
06:15:06.460 --> 06:15:07.900
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: our importation going down.

asr-005560
06:15:09.540 --> 06:15:10.100
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: And again,

asr-005561
06:15:11.020 --> 06:15:12.720
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: wala pa bang ibang magagawa?

asr-005562
06:15:13.240 --> 06:15:13.880
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Well, definitely,

asr-005563
06:15:14.260 --> 06:15:15.680
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: we will continue to support

asr-005564
06:15:15.680 --> 06:15:18.060
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: our local farmers

asr-005565
06:15:18.060 --> 06:15:19.980
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: and hopefully,

asr-005566
06:15:20.400 --> 06:15:21.800
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: tataas po yung kanilang production.

asr-005567
06:15:22.380 --> 06:15:23.820
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Hopefully, this will become a trend

asr-005568
06:15:23.820 --> 06:15:26.100
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: and as we continue to produce

asr-005569
06:15:26.100 --> 06:15:27.920
