asr-005570
06:15:27.920 --> 06:15:29.580
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: not only produce balay,

asr-005571
06:15:29.580 --> 06:15:31.320
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: but produce value

asr-005572
06:15:31.320 --> 06:15:33.600
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: for farmers, then more will

asr-005573
06:15:33.600 --> 06:15:35.340
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: continue to plant and our

asr-005574
06:15:35.340 --> 06:15:37.820
