Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Hindi na nga nga ilangan nung

asr-006171
06:48:01.480 --> 06:48:02.160
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: PowerPoint.

asr-006172
06:48:03.900 --> 06:48:05.700
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Well, this has to do with the

asr-006173
