07:17:23.960 --> 07:17:26.980
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: dahil sa halos kalahati ng budget,

asr-006958
07:17:27.280 --> 07:17:28.060
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: naka-FLR.

asr-006959
07:17:28.060 --> 07:17:29.640
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, talagang delayed.

asr-006960
07:17:30.000 --> 07:17:30.580
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: No?

asr-006961
07:17:31.600 --> 07:17:36.980
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Ah, Mr. Speaker, we will look into the watch portal, definitely po.

asr-006962
07:17:37.400 --> 07:17:39.040
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: And yung binigay po namin,

asr-006963
07:17:39.440 --> 07:17:42.760
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: actually, 46% of the budget,

asr-006964
07:17:42.980 --> 07:17:44.020
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: na-FLR po.

asr-006965
07:17:44.180 --> 07:17:45.380
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: For 2026,

asr-006966
07:17:45.940 --> 07:17:51.540
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: 1,699 projects have appropriations worth 34.2 billion.

asr-006967
07:17:52.180 --> 07:17:54.660
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Ilang porsyento po dito ang naka-FLR,

asr-006968
07:17:54.840 --> 07:17:56.360
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: o FISARO, yun yung term, no?

asr-006969
07:17:57.160 --> 07:17:59.320
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: FLR, for later release.

asr-006973
07:17:59.460 --> 07:18:04.500
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Ilang porsyento ng 2026 budget ang naka-FLR.

asr-006974
07:18:05.260 --> 07:18:05.500
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Okay.

asr-006975
07:18:07.500 --> 07:18:11.900
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Mr. Speaker, the 2026 budget will be...

asr-006976
07:18:11.900 --> 07:18:15.920
Deputy Speaker Yevgeny Vincente B. Emano: We'd like to request the good gentleman to wind up, please.

asr-006977
07:18:16.140 --> 07:18:16.520
Deputy Speaker Yevgeny Vincente B. Emano: Thank you.

asr-006978
07:18:18.720 --> 07:18:19.540
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Sige, go ahead, po.

asr-006979
07:18:21.900 --> 07:18:23.080
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Yes, Mr. Speaker.

asr-006980
07:18:23.080 --> 07:18:24.520
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Okay, thank you, Mr. Speaker.

asr-006981
07:18:24.520 --> 07:18:26.160
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: And just to let you know,

asr-006982
07:18:26.500 --> 07:18:29.420
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: that the 2026 budget will be released in...

asr-006983
07:18:29.420 --> 07:18:31.900
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: So, last August,

asr-006984
07:18:32.760 --> 07:18:37.860
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: 4.7 billion SARO was released by the DBM.

asr-006985
07:18:39.060 --> 07:18:39.780
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: And...

asr-006986
07:18:39.780 --> 07:18:43.300
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: September...

asr-006987
07:18:43.300 --> 07:18:44.160
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Sorry.

asr-006988
07:18:44.460 --> 07:18:47.360
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: And last Saturday, September 3, 18 billion,

asr-006989
07:18:48.180 --> 07:18:50.940
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: there was a omnibus SARO requested in June,

asr-006990
07:18:51.600 --> 07:18:53.420
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: and 18B was...

asr-006991
07:18:56.460 --> 07:18:59.380
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: The 18B, we are awaiting release.

asr-006992
07:18:59.420 --> 07:19:00.260
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Of this.

asr-006993
07:19:00.720 --> 07:19:04.460
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: So, as to whether there will be an FLR or not,

asr-006994
07:19:05.040 --> 07:19:06.680
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: that we do not know.

asr-006995
07:19:07.000 --> 07:19:07.440
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: And again,

asr-006996
07:19:09.500 --> 07:19:11.960
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: but our Secretary was assured

asr-006997
07:19:11.960 --> 07:19:15.740
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: that there will be no FLRs this year, Mr. Speaker.

asr-006998
07:19:15.860 --> 07:19:16.260
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: There will be.

asr-006999
07:19:16.540 --> 07:19:16.760
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Okay.

asr-007000
07:19:17.180 --> 07:19:19.980
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: To wrap up, kasi alam kong tapos na po yung oras,

asr-007001
07:19:20.060 --> 07:19:21.420
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: to wrap up the point here,

asr-007002
07:19:22.020 --> 07:19:23.480
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: ano po yung main reason

asr-007003
07:19:23.480 --> 07:19:26.840
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: kung bakit napakalaking bahagi

asr-007004
07:19:26.840 --> 07:19:28.680
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: ng farm-to-market road budget

asr-007005
07:19:28.680 --> 07:19:29.400
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: na isang...

asr-007006
07:19:29.420 --> 07:19:29.940
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: FLR,

asr-007007
07:19:30.420 --> 07:19:32.140
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: 40%

asr-007008
07:19:32.140 --> 07:19:34.220
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: in 2025,

asr-007009
07:19:35.220 --> 07:19:36.460
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: 2026,

asr-007010
07:19:37.400 --> 07:19:38.640
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: wala pang narirelease?

asr-007011
07:19:39.560 --> 07:19:40.600
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Ano po ang main reason

asr-007012
07:19:40.600 --> 07:19:41.420
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: kung bakit

asr-007013
07:19:41.420 --> 07:19:43.120
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: napakatagal

asr-007014
07:19:43.120 --> 07:19:44.080
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: ng implementation?

asr-007015
07:19:44.780 --> 07:19:46.020
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: It should be shovel-ready.

asr-007016
07:19:46.220 --> 07:19:47.380
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Dapat pag na-approve na,

asr-007017
07:19:48.360 --> 07:19:49.100
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: bidding na kagad,

asr-007018
07:19:49.220 --> 07:19:49.840
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: pero hindi po.

asr-007019
07:19:50.180 --> 07:19:50.960
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: It's FLR.

asr-007020
07:19:51.100 --> 07:19:51.960
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: What's the main reason?

asr-007021
07:19:52.840 --> 07:19:53.580
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Thank you.

asr-007022
07:19:54.220 --> 07:19:56.460
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: We share your concern, Mr. Speaker.

asr-007023
07:19:57.020 --> 07:19:57.420
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: However,

asr-007024
07:19:57.420 --> 07:19:58.620
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: hindi po kami

asr-007025
07:19:58.620 --> 07:19:59.420
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: at least

asr-007026
07:19:59.420 --> 07:20:00.920
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: at least hindi po yung department namin,

asr-007027
07:20:01.540 --> 07:20:03.220
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: which is the Department of Agriculture,

asr-007028
07:20:03.480 --> 07:20:06.040
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: is responsible for the FLR.

asr-007029
07:20:06.380 --> 07:20:08.700
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: And I think that we need to inquire po

asr-007030
07:20:08.700 --> 07:20:10.220
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: from the responsible department.

asr-007031
07:20:11.320 --> 07:20:12.080
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Well, Mr. Speaker,

asr-007032
07:20:12.220 --> 07:20:12.460
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: thank you.

asr-007033
07:20:12.520 --> 07:20:13.040
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: To conclude,

asr-007034
07:20:13.980 --> 07:20:14.720
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: actually,

asr-007035
07:20:15.040 --> 07:20:16.140
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: alam na natin yung dahilan.

asr-007036
07:20:16.320 --> 07:20:17.220
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: The DBM will say

asr-007037
07:20:17.220 --> 07:20:18.040
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: it is because

asr-007038
07:20:18.040 --> 07:20:22.440
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: these specific farm-to-market road projects

asr-007039
07:20:22.440 --> 07:20:25.040
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: are congressional amendments or insertions.

asr-007040
07:20:25.180 --> 07:20:25.920
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Yun ang sasabihin nila.

asr-007041
07:20:26.400 --> 07:20:27.060
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: And therefore,

asr-007042
07:20:27.680 --> 07:20:29.400
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: bago ma-release yung proyekto,

asr-007043
07:20:29.420 --> 07:20:33.260
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: kailangan mag-submit ng kompletong dokumento

asr-007044
07:20:33.260 --> 07:20:36.240
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: and it has to go a whole process of validation.

asr-007045
07:20:37.120 --> 07:20:40.000
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: And it takes the better part of the fiscal year.

asr-007046
07:20:40.620 --> 07:20:42.080
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Therefore, we have this situation

asr-007047
07:20:42.080 --> 07:20:46.380
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: where towards the end of the fiscal year,

asr-007048
07:20:47.220 --> 07:20:49.560
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: saka pa lang marirelease yung SARO.

asr-007049
07:20:50.200 --> 07:20:52.860
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, ang gusto ko lang i-point out, Mr. Speaker, dito,

asr-007050
07:20:53.420 --> 07:20:54.780
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: ay pinapakita,

asr-007051
07:20:55.360 --> 07:20:57.820
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: hindi lang po nangyayari sa DA budget ito.

asr-007052
07:20:57.820 --> 07:20:59.400
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, this happens in the,

asr-007053
07:20:59.420 --> 07:21:03.720
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: this happens in the DPWH budget.

asr-007054
07:21:04.400 --> 07:21:10.560
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: All programs with capital outlay for the most part,

asr-007055
07:21:11.160 --> 07:21:16.580
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: malaking bahagi nun ay FISARO or FLR for later release.

asr-007056
07:21:17.300 --> 07:21:19.020
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Because, in other words,

asr-007057
07:21:19.120 --> 07:21:20.260
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: ang tinuturo na po rito,

asr-007058
07:21:20.400 --> 07:21:23.140
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: yung problema sa system of budgeting,

asr-007059
07:21:23.280 --> 07:21:25.140
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: sa paraan ng pagbabudget natin,

asr-007060
07:21:25.980 --> 07:21:29.160
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: particularly the system of congressional insertion or amendment,

asr-007061
07:21:29.420 --> 07:21:32.560
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: we see how, because of this,

asr-007062
07:21:33.320 --> 07:21:36.080
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: ay nade-delay po.

asr-007063
07:21:37.560 --> 07:21:41.240
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Minimum two years na po bago makompleto ang proyekto.

asr-007064
07:21:41.800 --> 07:21:42.800
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: And even more,

asr-007065
07:21:43.600 --> 07:21:45.180
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: para makompleto ang proyekto,

asr-007066
07:21:45.540 --> 07:21:50.000
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: because of this archaic system

asr-007067
07:21:50.000 --> 07:21:53.560
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: which we call pork barrel system.

asr-007068
07:21:54.260 --> 07:21:56.160
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Yung congressional insertions.

asr-007069
07:21:56.680 --> 07:21:58.160
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Ang epekto po nito,

asr-007070
07:21:58.160 --> 07:22:00.160
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: delayed ang delivery

asr-007071
07:22:00.160 --> 07:22:04.420
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: nung kinakailangang infrastructure sa mamamayan.

asr-007072
07:22:04.420 --> 07:22:08.660
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Kaya, again, tinututulang po natin ito,

asr-007073
07:22:08.660 --> 07:22:10.160
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: hindi lang issue ng corruption.

asr-007074
07:22:10.160 --> 07:22:11.420
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: May issue ng corruption,

asr-007075
07:22:11.420 --> 07:22:13.420
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: iwalay na usapin yan.

asr-007076
07:22:13.420 --> 07:22:15.920
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Ipapang-usapin dito yung actual delay

asr-007077
07:22:15.920 --> 07:22:17.920
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: in the delivery of services

asr-007078
07:22:17.920 --> 07:22:19.920
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: and the tying up of funds

asr-007079
07:22:19.920 --> 07:22:21.920
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: that perhaps could be better

asr-007080
07:22:21.920 --> 07:22:26.380
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: or more urgently used elsewhere.

asr-007081
07:22:26.380 --> 07:22:28.060
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: In the delivery of services.

asr-007082
07:22:28.060 --> 07:22:30.060
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, hanggang doon na lang po,

asr-007083
07:22:30.060 --> 07:22:32.060
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Mr. Speaker, maraming salamat.

asr-007084
07:22:32.060 --> 07:22:34.060
Deputy Speaker Yevgeny Vincente B. Emano: Thank you. Thank you. Thank you very much,

asr-007085
07:22:34.060 --> 07:22:36.060
Deputy Speaker Yevgeny Vincente B. Emano: Honorable Tinio. Majority Leader.

asr-007086
