asr-007097
07:23:04.060 --> 07:23:08.060
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: there being no member from the minority

asr-007098
07:23:08.060 --> 07:23:12.060
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: to interpolate on the budget of Department of Agriculture

asr-007099
07:23:12.060 --> 07:23:15.060
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: for fiscal year 2027,

asr-007100
07:23:15.060 --> 07:23:17.060
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: this representation moves to terminate

asr-007101
07:23:17.060 --> 07:23:19.060
