asr-007102
07:23:19.060 --> 07:23:22.060
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: for the consideration of budget

asr-007103
07:23:22.060 --> 07:23:24.060
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: of the Department of Agriculture

asr-007104
07:23:24.060 --> 07:23:26.060
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: and its attached agencies

asr-007105
07:23:26.060 --> 07:23:28.060
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: for fiscal year 2027.

asr-007106
