asr-007117
07:23:53.060 --> 07:23:54.060
Deputy Speaker Yevgeny Vincente B. Emano: Chair hears none.

asr-007118
07:23:54.060 --> 07:23:56.060
Deputy Speaker Yevgeny Vincente B. Emano: The interpolation on the proposed budget

asr-007119
07:23:56.060 --> 07:23:58.060
