asr-007287
07:35:53.520 --> 07:35:55.220
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: year 2027,

asr-007288
07:35:56.000 --> 07:35:57.820
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: is a forward-looking investment

asr-007289
07:35:57.820 --> 07:35:59.260
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: in the government's capacity

asr-007290
07:35:59.600 --> 07:36:02.020
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: to protect the Filipino people.

asr-007291
07:36:02.780 --> 07:36:04.620
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: When a child walks into school,

asr-007292
07:36:05.500 --> 07:36:08.140
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: the first duty of government is to make sure

asr-007293
07:36:08.140 --> 07:36:10.980
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: that the child comes home safely.

asr-007294
07:36:11.760 --> 07:36:15.200
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: When a mother closes the door of her home at night,

asr-007295
07:36:16.640 --> 07:36:19.600
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: she must have confidence that the streets outside

asr-007296
07:36:20.300 --> 07:36:22.460
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: are governed by law and order.

asr-007297
07:36:23.320 --> 07:36:25.940
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: And when a community faces a criminal threat,

asr-007298
07:36:25.940 --> 07:36:29.120
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: a disaster, or an act of violence,

asr-007299
07:36:29.120 --> 07:36:31.580
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: our people should not have to wonder

asr-007300
07:36:31.580 --> 07:36:34.100
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: whether their government has the people,

asr-007301
07:36:34.720 --> 07:36:38.460
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: equipment, coordination, and resources to protect them.

asr-007302
07:36:39.560 --> 07:36:42.940
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Mr. Speaker, security begins

asr-007303
07:36:42.940 --> 07:36:45.860
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: where government becomes personal.

asr-007304
07:36:46.760 --> 07:36:50.100
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: It begins in the barangay where disputes first emerge,

asr-007305
07:36:50.780 --> 07:36:52.840
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: emergencies are first reported,

asr-007306
07:36:52.840 --> 07:36:55.820
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: and the first response to a crisis

asr-007307
07:36:55.820 --> 07:36:58.120
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: can determine whether it remains contained.

asr-007308
07:36:58.120 --> 07:37:02.480
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: The municipality and city coordinate services

asr-007309
07:37:02.480 --> 07:37:06.980
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: that no individual barangay can provide alone.

asr-007310
07:37:07.620 --> 07:37:11.380
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: While the province brings together municipalities and cities

asr-007311
07:37:11.380 --> 07:37:16.060
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: and strengthens the broader peace and order architecture,

asr-007312
07:37:16.880 --> 07:37:20.800
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: at every level, there must be capability.

asr-007313
07:37:21.540 --> 07:37:24.540
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: At every level, there must be accountability.

asr-007314
07:37:24.540 --> 07:37:27.540
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: And at every level, there must be

asr-007315
07:37:28.120 --> 07:37:29.120
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: a government

asr-007316
07:37:29.120 --> 07:37:30.620
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: capable of responding

asr-007317
07:37:30.620 --> 07:37:32.960
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: when Filipino lives are at risk.

asr-007318
07:37:33.740 --> 07:37:37.300
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: This is why funding the DILG is fundamentally about

asr-007319
07:37:37.300 --> 07:37:41.820
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: funding the capacity of government to protect our people.

asr-007320
07:37:42.960 --> 07:37:46.360
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Mr. Speaker, the DILG and its attached agencies

asr-007321
07:37:46.360 --> 07:37:49.360
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: have demonstrated that this responsibility

asr-007322
07:37:49.360 --> 07:37:51.140
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: is being taken seriously.

asr-007323
07:37:51.980 --> 07:37:56.400
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: The department has posted a 96.33%

asr-007324
07:37:56.400 --> 07:38:01.260
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: efficiency rate in emergency response

asr-007330
07:38:01.260 --> 07:38:05.720
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: with response time of 5 to 7 minutes.

asr-007331
07:38:06.200 --> 07:38:12.160
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: We now have 50,441 evacuation centers nationwide

asr-007332
07:38:12.160 --> 07:38:18.280
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: supported by more than 126,000 uniformed personnel

asr-007333
07:38:18.280 --> 07:38:20.280
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: deployed for disaster response.

asr-007334
07:38:20.320 --> 07:38:23.940
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: to address emerging security concerns

asr-007335
07:38:23.940 --> 07:38:27.520
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: including nihilistic violent extremism,

asr-007337
07:38:28.100 --> 07:38:30.460
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: NVE, the DILG

asr-007338
07:38:30.460 --> 07:38:32.340
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: has strengthened school security

asr-007339
07:38:32.340 --> 07:38:34.280
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: protocols and safer

asr-007340
07:38:34.280 --> 07:38:35.180
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: school zones,

asr-007341
07:38:36.060 --> 07:38:38.060
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: deepened coordination with the Department

asr-007342
07:38:38.060 --> 07:38:40.360
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: of Education, and enhanced

asr-007343
07:38:40.360 --> 07:38:42.100
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: police-community partnership

asr-007344
07:38:42.100 --> 07:38:43.960
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: including barangay peace

asr-007345
07:38:43.960 --> 07:38:45.900
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: and safety mechanisms.

asr-007346
07:38:46.640 --> 07:38:48.180
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: I therefore urge this

asr-007347
07:38:48.180 --> 07:38:50.120
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: August Chamber to support

asr-007348
07:38:50.120 --> 07:38:51.940
