Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: We now rank first in Asia in terms of gender parity score because of the Philippine Commission on Women.

asr-007589
07:47:37.480 --> 07:47:46.700
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Our hajj regissants continue their safe pilgrimage with the aid of the National Commission for Muslim Filipinos.

asr-007590
