asr-007592
07:48:01.980 --> 07:48:09.440
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: This accomplishment reminds us that public safety and good governance are interconnected.

asr-007593
07:48:10.480 --> 07:48:15.700
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: A community is safer when its local government is capable.

asr-007594
07:48:16.560 --> 07:48:18.980
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: A disaster response is faster when...

asr-007595
07:48:19.380 --> 07:48:28.360
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Local governments are prepared, and public institutions earn trust when they demonstrate both competence and accountability.

asr-007596
07:48:29.440 --> 07:48:32.480
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Mr. Speaker, we should remember the words of Nelson Mandela.

asr-007597
07:48:33.620 --> 07:48:39.400
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Every community in our country has a fundamental right to be free from fear.

asr-007598
07:48:40.160 --> 07:48:43.520
