Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ang number one po sa mga NGAs pagdating sa total GAD budget allocation, gayon din po sa percentage ng utilization, ay ang Department of Labor and Employment.

asr-010548
09:47:27.820 --> 09:47:37.640
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Sinasabi po dito na ang kanilang agency budget nasa 36 billion at ang GAD budget allocation ay 30.2 billion.

asr-010549
09:47:37.940 --> 09:47:43.260
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ibig sabihin, nasa 83% ng budget ng DOLE, integrated ang GAD.

asr-010550
09:47:44.860 --> 09:47:57.900
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ito po bang figures na ito ay may review, ang PCW, ang compliant po ba lahat ng mga programa TAG as utilized for the gender and development mandate?

asr-010551
09:47:58.780 --> 09:48:01.680
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Yes, may review and may OV din po yan.

asr-010552
09:48:03.540 --> 09:48:05.080
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: May means of verification.

asr-010553
09:48:05.560 --> 09:48:05.780
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Alright.

asr-010554
09:48:05.780 --> 09:48:07.280
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Mr. Speaker.

asr-010555
09:48:07.940 --> 09:48:28.920
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: And may department rin kasi for women's, may Bureau of Women's, and actually maraming po talagang batas, ILO, Convention, and matagal na po silang, and number two na rin po sila nung panahon ni FVR.

asr-010556
09:48:30.100 --> 09:48:30.580
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Mr. Speaker.

asr-010557
09:48:30.860 --> 09:48:34.320
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Maraming salamat, Mr. Speaker, Distinguished Sponsor.

asr-010558
09:48:34.820 --> 09:48:36.780
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: At kasama rin po dito halimbawa,

asr-010559
09:48:37.940 --> 09:48:47.220
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: isa po sa mga top performing, number five po ang Philippine Army, na nag-record ng 15.37%.

asr-010560
09:48:47.220 --> 09:48:54.620
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: At sa diskusyon po kagabi, dito sa plenaryo, na alam ko po ang PCW yung nag-e-endorse,

asr-010561
09:48:54.800 --> 09:49:01.420
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: na dapat po endorse ninyo yung mga GAD plan and budget ng iba't-ibang mga agencies.

asr-010562
09:49:01.420 --> 09:49:07.900
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ang sabi po nila, isa sa mga activities na parte ng kanilang GAD.

asr-010563
09:49:07.940 --> 09:49:12.160
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: GAD plan ay ang pagkakaroon po ng Men's Rights Seminar.

asr-010564
09:49:13.020 --> 09:49:16.300
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Tama po ba? Inendorse po ba ito ng PCW?

asr-010565
09:49:18.100 --> 09:49:21.900
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Men's, just for clarification, Men's Rights?

asr-010566
09:49:22.180 --> 09:49:22.400
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Yes.

asr-010567
09:49:22.400 --> 09:49:24.000
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Inendorse ng PCW?

asr-010568
09:49:24.300 --> 09:49:24.580
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Yes.

asr-010569
09:49:25.860 --> 09:49:35.360
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: I was asking, Mr. Speaker, if the PCW endorsed this particular seminar as part of the GAD plan and budget of the DND.

asr-010570
09:49:37.940 --> 09:49:45.440
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: So, can we verify, we don't remember if may endorsement po ang PCW?

asr-010571
09:49:46.440 --> 09:49:48.480
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Kasi kababayan po yung tinututukan.

asr-010572
09:49:48.820 --> 09:49:53.720
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: So, can we just get back to that, Madam Speaker, Mr. Speaker?

asr-010573
09:49:54.860 --> 09:49:55.840
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Maraming salamat po.

asr-010574
09:49:56.140 --> 09:50:01.320
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Isang ayon sa advisory ng PCW tungkol sa utilization ng GAD fund.

asr-010575
09:50:01.320 --> 09:50:07.580
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Pag sinabi po natin ang gender and development, hindi lang po ito tungkol, siyempre, sa mga kababaihan.

asr-010576
09:50:07.580 --> 09:50:14.160
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Pero tungkol po ito sa pagiging pantay ng mga kasarian, babae, lalaki, gender diverse people,

asr-010577
09:50:14.820 --> 09:50:18.680
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: equal rights, equal opportunities, equal access to services.

asr-010578
09:50:19.300 --> 09:50:22.420
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Yun po ang nais natin na magawa.

asr-010579
09:50:23.000 --> 09:50:32.140
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Kaya po, asa ngayon po ba hindi ma-confirm ng PCW kung ang particular seminar na ito ay mayroong endorsement mula sa kanila?

asr-010580
09:50:33.080 --> 09:50:37.460
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Can we get the details of when was the seminar?

asr-010581
09:50:37.640 --> 09:50:39.280
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Ano yung particular ng seminar?

asr-010582
09:50:39.860 --> 09:50:41.860
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: So that we can answer appropriately.

asr-010583
09:50:42.500 --> 09:50:49.280
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: But, totoo po na PCW supports equal rights, Mr. Speaker.

asr-010584
09:50:49.700 --> 09:50:50.500
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Women and men.

asr-010585
09:50:52.280 --> 09:50:57.160
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: But it's usually, doon lang po yung aking kasagutan.

asr-010586
09:50:59.380 --> 09:51:01.380
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Maraming salamat po, Mr. Speaker.

asr-010587
09:51:02.160 --> 09:51:06.800
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Mr. Sponsor, sa totoo lang po, nag-react po ako dito sa naulat sa atin.

asr-010588
09:51:07.580 --> 09:51:11.340
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ang paggamit ng GAD budget para dito.

asr-010589
09:51:11.820 --> 09:51:18.340
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Dahil nag-a-advance yung ganitong tipo ng movement, na hindi ko na po gusto sabihin,

asr-010590
09:51:18.920 --> 09:51:21.660
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: ng zero-sum agenda.

asr-010591
09:51:22.480 --> 09:51:25.240
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Zero-sum agenda pagdating sa gender equality.

asr-010592
09:51:25.460 --> 09:51:34.480
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: As if yung gains ng mga kababaihan sa pagtutulak ng pantay na karapatan ay kawalan ng ibang kasarian.

asr-010593
09:51:34.480 --> 09:51:36.260
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Na hindi naman po ganun, diba?

asr-010594
09:51:36.640 --> 09:51:37.480
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: ang tinutulak

asr-010595
09:51:37.580 --> 09:51:39.480
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: natin pagdating sa gender equality.

asr-010596
09:51:39.860 --> 09:51:43.500
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Pag sinabi natin na gender equality, pantay na karapatang pantao.

asr-010597
09:51:44.320 --> 09:51:48.200
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Pantay na access, pantay na opportunities.

asr-010598
09:51:49.060 --> 09:51:53.920
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: At sa tingin ko po, dapat ma-review ito mabuti ng PCW.

asr-010599
09:51:54.360 --> 09:52:01.440
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Na hindi po natin papayagan ang kahit anong tipo ng amplification, ng backlash sa women's movement.

asr-010600
09:52:01.440 --> 09:52:06.440
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ngayon pa lang po, napaka-alaki na ng paniningil.

asr-010601
09:52:07.580 --> 09:52:17.380
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Para bang yung kababaihan pa po ang may kasalanan na kung bakit sinasabi nila na meron pang hindi pantay na mga karapatan.

asr-010602
09:52:17.500 --> 09:52:24.540
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Samantalang, ang dahilan naman po kung bakit may particular attention tayo sa women's rights,

asr-010603
09:52:25.020 --> 09:52:27.160
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: sa access ng women sa iba't ibang services.

asr-010604
09:52:27.420 --> 09:52:29.980
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Dahil sa karapatan pa lang sa pagboto.

asr-010605
09:52:30.520 --> 09:52:34.300
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: No, 1937 pa lang natin nakuha yung pantay na karapatan.

asr-010606
09:52:34.300 --> 09:52:37.460
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Dito sa kapulungan na ito sa kongreso, 1941 lang.

asr-010607
09:52:37.580 --> 09:52:40.480
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Unang nagkaroon na representative na babae.

asr-010608
09:52:40.940 --> 09:52:45.580
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Kaya po, ibig sabihin, marami tayong mga batas, marami tayong mga panukala.

asr-010609
09:52:45.900 --> 09:52:50.300
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ang wala pong benepisyon ng perspektiba ng mga kababaihan sa pagpapatupad.

asr-010610
09:52:51.240 --> 09:52:59.200
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Yan nga pong dahilan kung bakit ang PCW, meron din silang sinusulong na women's priority legislative agenda.

asr-010611
09:52:59.200 --> 09:53:07.140
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Para po, yung mga nakikita natin, mga discriminatory pa, ng mga probisyon sa ating mga batas, ay tuluyan na natin maibasura.

asr-010612
09:53:07.580 --> 09:53:11.600
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Kaya po, nananawagan ako, Mr. Speaker, Mr. Sponsor sa PCW,

asr-010613
09:53:11.740 --> 09:53:17.080
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: sana naman po yung ating mga i-endorso ng mga GAD plan and budget.

asr-010614
09:53:17.200 --> 09:53:21.820
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Matiyak po natin na kada seminar, kada activity, kada proyekto dyan,

asr-010615
09:53:21.920 --> 09:53:25.120
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: ay tunay na magsusulong po ng pantay na karapatan.

asr-010616
09:53:25.220 --> 09:53:28.260
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Hindi lang po ng babae, ng lahat, ng Pilipino.

asr-010617
09:53:29.240 --> 09:53:35.680
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Nabanggit ko po ito dahil I'm concerning na maliit na nga po ang budget ng PCW, lalo pang niliitan.

asr-010618
09:53:35.680 --> 09:53:45.180
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Meron pong 13% budget cut ang PCW, lalong-lalo na sa kanilang programa para sa planning, management, and monitoring

asr-010619
09:53:45.280 --> 09:53:49.280
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: ng gender mainstreaming rules sa ilalim ng Magna Carta of Women.

asr-010620
09:53:49.380 --> 09:53:57.280
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Meron ding malaking kaltas ang provision ng technical assistance, advisory, at capacity building on gender and development.

asr-010621
09:53:57.380 --> 09:54:05.180
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ibig sabihin, yung pinaka ginagawa po ng PCW para matiyak na talagang compliant ang lahat po ng agency

asr-010622
09:54:05.180 --> 09:54:08.080
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: sa integration, hindi separation ng GAD budget.

asr-010623
09:54:08.180 --> 09:54:14.080
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Yun po kasing nakita nating trend pa rin ngayon sa mga agencies na parang laging hiwalay yung GAD budget

asr-010624
09:54:14.180 --> 09:54:19.080
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: imbis na integrated sa kanilang mga mayor na programa.

asr-010625
09:54:19.180 --> 09:54:25.080
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Nananawagan po tayo na ibalik sa 2026 level yung pondo para sa mga nasabing programa

asr-010626
09:54:25.180 --> 09:54:35.080
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: at kung hindi man, mataasan pa po kahit po kaunti, augmentation para sa mahalagang ginagawa ng ating mga policy making bodies

asr-010627
09:54:35.280 --> 09:54:44.080
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: ng PCW, nandito rin po ang NYC, at mga kasamahan po natin na magiging gabay para sa grounded na policy making,

asr-010628
09:54:44.180 --> 09:54:50.080
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: decision making dito man sa Kongreso at maski po sa lokal na mga konseho natin.

asr-010629
09:54:50.180 --> 09:54:59.080
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ngayon naman, Mr. Speaker, Distinguished Sponsor, nais kong magtanong tungkol sa kalagayan ng mga public markets.

asr-010630
09:54:59.180 --> 09:55:04.080
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Nabanggit ko na rin po ito noong budget briefing.

asr-010631
09:55:04.080 --> 09:55:13.980
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Nagtanong po ako, meron po bang monitoring ang DILG tungkol sa mga fees na sinisingil sa market vendors sa iba't ibang LGU?

asr-010632
09:55:14.080 --> 09:55:24.980
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Meron po ba tayo ngayong mekanismo para tiyakin na wala pong exorbitant, excessive, or redundant fees na sinisingil sa mga LGU

asr-010633
09:55:25.080 --> 09:55:32.980
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: pagdating po sa pagtatakda ng iba't ibang mga binabayaran sa mga pampublikong palengke sa ating bansa?

asr-010634
09:55:32.980 --> 09:55:40.880
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Halimbawa na lang, Ginoong Speaker, mula po sa aming consultation among market vendors sa San Andres Market,

asr-010635
09:55:40.980 --> 09:55:48.880
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: sinabi po nila na 169 pesos kada araw ang renta mula 60 pesos lang noong 2016.

asr-010636
09:55:48.980 --> 09:55:59.880
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Nandyan din po sa Santa Ana Market na tumaas ang kanilang renta from 35 pesos to 120 pesos kada araw.

asr-010637
09:55:59.980 --> 09:56:01.880
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ganun din po.

asr-010638
09:56:01.880 --> 09:56:09.780
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Yung patong-patong na fees, isa-isahin ko lang po mula po sa binabayaran na nila sa mga business permit.

asr-010639
09:56:09.880 --> 09:56:21.780
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Nandyan din po ang ating fire safety inspection certificate fee, my health certificate fee, utilities fee, garbage fee, developer fee, annual contract renewal fees.

asr-010640
09:56:21.880 --> 09:56:31.780
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Nakaka... hindi naman po nakakagulag pero nakaka... lungkot na malaman na ang makaka...

asr-010641
09:56:31.780 --> 09:56:33.760
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: mga market vendors po natin, hindi naman po

asr-010642
09:56:33.760 --> 09:56:35.360
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: yan yung mga malalaking negosyo.

asr-010643
09:56:35.980 --> 09:56:37.820
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Kaya nung nalaman po natin

asr-010644
09:56:37.820 --> 09:56:39.680
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: na patong-patong po pala yung fees

asr-010645
09:56:39.680 --> 09:56:41.640
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: na kanilang mga binabayaran.

asr-010646
09:56:42.120 --> 09:56:43.920
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Nais po natin malaman kung ano po

asr-010647
09:56:43.920 --> 09:56:45.540
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: yung ginagawa ng DILG

asr-010648
09:56:45.540 --> 09:56:48.160
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: sa kanila pong mandato ng general supervision

asr-010649
09:56:48.160 --> 09:56:50.220
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: para matiyak na yung kapangyarihan

asr-010650
09:56:50.220 --> 09:56:51.920
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: ng ating LGU, yung kanilang local

asr-010651
09:56:51.920 --> 09:56:54.100
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: autonomy sa determination ng ganitong

asr-010652
09:56:54.100 --> 09:56:56.160
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: mga fees ng market administration

asr-010653
09:56:56.160 --> 09:56:57.540
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: ay atin pong

asr-010654
09:56:57.540 --> 09:56:59.560
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: natitiyak na

asr-010655
09:56:59.560 --> 09:57:02.260
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: hindi po sumasobra sa kanilang kapangyarihan.

asr-010656
09:57:03.020 --> 09:57:03.900
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Yes, Madam

asr-010657
09:57:03.900 --> 09:57:05.940
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Speaker, I totally understand

asr-010658
09:57:05.940 --> 09:57:07.740
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: where you're coming from, but

asr-010659
09:57:07.740 --> 09:57:10.080
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: ang mandato po ng DILG

asr-010660
09:57:10.080 --> 09:57:11.980
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: is supervision over

asr-010661
09:57:11.980 --> 09:57:13.960
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: the LGUs. Alam naman natin may

asr-010662
09:57:13.960 --> 09:57:16.100
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: autonomy po sila, but

asr-010663
09:57:16.100 --> 09:57:17.920
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: they have to, as long as they

asr-010664
09:57:17.920 --> 09:57:19.980
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: follow the process, as long

asr-010665
09:57:19.980 --> 09:57:22.000
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: as na pasa

asr-010666
09:57:22.000 --> 09:57:23.440
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: po yung tax ordinance,

asr-010667
09:57:24.080 --> 09:57:26.020
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: nagkaroon po ng public consultation,

asr-010668
09:57:26.760 --> 09:57:27.920
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: so these are the processes

asr-010669
09:57:27.920 --> 09:57:29.480
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: na kailangan po.

asr-010670
09:57:29.560 --> 09:57:31.280
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Bago po tayo magpataw na

asr-010671
09:57:31.280 --> 09:57:32.940
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: makaragdagan ng mga buwis,

asr-010672
09:57:33.540 --> 09:57:35.500
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: but hanggang doon lang po yung

asr-010673
09:57:35.500 --> 09:57:37.060
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: limitasyon ng DILG

asr-010674
09:57:37.060 --> 09:57:39.540
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: is to supervise, because we respect

asr-010675
09:57:39.540 --> 09:57:41.500
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: the autonomy also of our

asr-010676
09:57:41.500 --> 09:57:43.460
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: local government units.

asr-010677
09:57:43.960 --> 09:57:45.420
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Basta as long as it's not

asr-010678
09:57:45.420 --> 09:57:47.660
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: abusive, they follow the process,

asr-010679
09:57:48.380 --> 09:57:49.860
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: yun lang po ang ginagawa

asr-010680
09:57:49.860 --> 09:57:51.300
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: ng sangay ng DILG.

asr-010681
09:57:52.180 --> 09:57:53.700
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Mr. Speaker, paano po

asr-010682
09:57:53.700 --> 09:57:55.520
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: ang inyong mekanismo para sa

asr-010683
09:57:55.520 --> 09:57:57.780
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: monitoring pagdating dyan?

asr-010684
09:57:58.220 --> 09:57:59.360
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Meron po ba tayong

asr-010685
09:57:59.360 --> 09:58:00.020
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: redress?

